 is conservatively applicable as an obligation until that effect boundary is closed; this records no physical command, target, authority, response, or occurrence. This exact-source Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"ACTUATOR-0.3-feedback-and-interlocks":{"declaration":{"effect_feedback":"Only retained checker outcomes and exact replay evidence are observed; external-effect feedback is NOT_ESTABLISHED.","failure_states":"Malformed, contradictory, stale, unsupported, over-limit, signature-failing or open-effect inputs remain FAIL or UNKNOWN; external target state remains UNKNOWN.","interlocks":"Schema, digest, ordering, witness-key, control-surface and finite-budget checks interlock retained-result admission, not a physical safe state.","recovery":"A corrected immutable input may be checked by a fresh bounded replay. No external rollback, compensation or actuator safe-state recovery is claimed."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:d54598eba14fabc22dcf397ee6db6210d113cdbaf93508229a0c7b6603aa064e","reason":"The owned actor graph has unresolved imported and caller-supplied call targets. ACTUATOR is conservatively applicable as an obligation until that effect boundary is closed; this records no physical command, target, authority, response, or occurrence. This exact-source Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"ASSET-0.1-identity-and-quantity":{"declaration":{"identity":"The ACTOR verifier retains ASSET.identity as a Tier-0 obligation because the sole authored reasons.vstd selects conservative APPLIES while its owned closed-effect boundary is open. The concrete mechanism value and any external occurrence remain NOT_ESTABLISHED.","precision":"The ACTOR verifier retains ASSET.precision as a Tier-0 obligation because the sole authored reasons.vstd selects conservative APPLIES while its owned closed-effect boundary is open. The concrete me