oncrete mechanism value and any external occurrence remain NOT_ESTABLISHED.","intervention":"The COLLECTIVE verifier retains FINBOT.intervention as a Tier-0 obligation because the sole authored reasons.vstd selects conservative APPLIES while its owned closed-effect boundary is open. The concrete mechanism value and any external occurrence remain NOT_ESTABLISHED.","limit_enforcement":"The COLLECTIVE verifier retains FINBOT.limit_enforcement as a Tier-0 obligation because the sole authored reasons.vstd selects conservative APPLIES while its owned closed-effect boundary is open. The concrete mechanism value and any external occurrence remain NOT_ESTABLISHED.","reconciliation_and_recovery":"The COLLECTIVE verifier retains FINBOT.reconciliation_and_recovery as a Tier-0 obligation because the sole authored reasons.vstd selects conservative APPLIES while its owned closed-effect boundary is open. The concrete mechanism value and any external occurrence remain NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:db0d7b289535cfdca6f393be6bd8ef5fb630b34e2e0a8cfd39cea4520a502898","reason":"The sole authored reasons.vstd conservatively selects APPLIES for vstd-collective as FINBOT so every FINBOT obligation remains required while the owned closed-effect boundary is open. This obligation-retention decision is distinct from source-role evidence and establishes neither a concrete mechanism, authority, external effect, occurrence, checker PASS, nor Tier-1-plus fulfillment. This exact-source Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"LEDGER-0.1-authoritative-history":{"declaration":{"authority":"The caller selects the retained ROLE inventory and COLLECTIVE evidence. Successful replay establishes internal consistency only, not legal, financial, operational or external ledger authority.","history":"collective_closure.py replays the exact retained ROLE decision inventory as one finite declared history; it does not establish a live or externally authoritative ledger.","ordering":"Decision identifiers are unique, instants are nondecreasing, and every instant must lie inside the selected point or period before the declared ledger is accepted.","state":"State is the retained set of decision identifiers, instants, decision classes, ROLE references and selected point or period; no account, asset or external system state is asserted."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:db0d7b289535cfdca6f393be6bd8ef5fb630b34e2e0a8cfd39cea4520a502898","reason":"collective_closure.py replays a complete finite declared ledger of retained ROLE decision identifiers, instants and references, rejecting duplicates, decreasing order and out-of-period entries without claiming external authority. This exact-source Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"LEDGER-0.2-accounting-invariants":{"declaration":{"balance_rules":"No debit, credit, conservation or account-balance equation is present; completeness and reference matching are the only retained-history invariants checked here.","rounding":"No quantity arithmetic or rounding is performed. Exact retained identifiers, integer positions and declared instants are compared without an inferred tolerance.","sources_and_sinks":"The selected ROLE decision inventory is the sole bounded source of ledger entries. The verifier neither creates decisions nor observes an external source or sink.","units":"The replay uses finite decision records, identifiers, positions and declared instants. It defines no monetary unit, quantity scale or independently calibrated clock."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:db0d7b289535cfdca6f393be6bd8ef5fb630b34e2e0a8cfd39cea4520a502898","reason":"collective_closure.py replays a complete finite declared ledger of retained ROLE decision identifiers, instants and references, rejecting duplicates, decreasing order and out-of-period entries without claiming external authority. This exact-source Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"LEDGER-0.3-correction-and-recovery":{"declaration":{"corrections":"A changed decision record requires a newly selected evidence coordinate and complete replay; the verifier does not mutate or silently amend retained history.","reconciliation":"COLLECTIVE component references are matched against the complete replayed ROLE inventory; no external ledger, account or real-world occurrence is reconciled.","recovery":"Recovery consists of supplying a corrected complete retained inventory and rerunning the bounded closure checks. No live rollback, compensation or external restoration is performed.","replay":"Replay rebuilds the declared ledger from exact retained ROLE decisions and rejects duplicate identifiers, decreasing instants and out-of-period entries."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:db0d7b289535cfdca6f393be6bd8ef5fb630b34e2e0a8cfd39cea4520a502898","reason":"collective_closure.py replays a complete finite declared ledger of retained ROLE decision identifiers, instants and references, rejecting duplicates, decreasing order and out-of-period entries without claiming external authority. This exact-source Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"MARKET-0.1-orders-and-access":{"declaration":{"cancellation":"The COLLECTIVE verifier retains MARKET.cancellation as a Tier-0 obligation because the sole authored reasons.vstd selects conservative APPLIES while its owned closed-effect boundary is open. The concrete mechanism value and any external occurrence remain NOT_ESTABLISHED.","order_states":"The COLLECTIVE verifier retains MARKET.order_states as a Tier-0 obligation because the sole authored reasons.vstd selects conservative APPLIES while its owned closed-effect boundary is open. The concrete mechanism value and any external occurrence remain NOT_ESTABLISHED.","participant_access":"The COLLECTIVE verifier 