replay retained scope, presentation, occupancy, and lifecycle records; they authenticate no bearer, issuer, clock, role authority, consent, or live occupancy. Occupancy lifecycle enforces nonempty validity (domains/identity.py:33-34) and rejects event instants that move backward (domains/identity.py:93-94) on one declared clock.","status":"APPLIES"},"TOKEN":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:88ae27a3550c98ee30d1168945f7003288aef2b7345b8241bd8af97f63b4db0c","reason":"Audited original-kind profile verifier-package-original-kind-retained-partial revision 2 (sha256:05f910901fae9778428b9c20ea650a9af1e62bfbe2e371995a0df8db9f0de258) binds this object and exact owned source set. The identity sources bind a declared HUMAN, AGENT, or BOT bearer to a ROLE seat and replay retained scope, presentation, occupancy, and lifecycle records; they authenticate no bearer, issuer, clock, role authority, consent, or live occupancy. Support envelopes are Ed25519-signed under a configured source key with purpose and scope, validity tenure, issued_at freshness lease and ACTIVE status witnesses (identity_presentation.py:455-518).","status":"APPLIES"},"TRAIN":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:88ae27a3550c98ee30d1168945f7003288aef2b7345b8241bd8af97f63b4db0c","reason":"Audited original-kind profile verifier-package-original-kind-retained-partial revision 2 (sha256:05f910901fae9778428b9c20ea650a9af1e62bfbe2e371995a0df8db9f0de258) binds this object and exact owned source set. The identity sources bind a declared HUMAN, AGENT, or BOT bearer to a ROLE seat and replay retained scope, presentation, occupancy, and lifecycle records; they authenticate no bearer, issuer, clock, role authority, consent, or live occupancy. identity_lifecycle.py:479 crosses the imported VerificationSession evaluation boundary, so TRAIN effects are not proved unreachable. The sole reasons.vstd retains TRAIN; no such effect, authority or checker PASS is claimed.","status":"APPLIES"},"TRANSACTION":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:4a4c9f8322ad5cde9a6b212d233095a6f73f5f54516d47bacd9117b2b303a3a8","reason":"The IDENTITY implementation and same-prefix contracts computes and returns assessments or certificate bytes without committing a live state change or external effect with atomicity, finality, compensation, or retry semantics.","status":"DOES_NOT_APPLY"},"VERIFIER":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:88ae27a3550c98ee30d1168945f7003288aef2b7345b8241bd8af97f63b4db0c","reason":"Audited original-kind profile verifier-package-original-kind-retained-partial revision 2 (sha256:05f910901fae9778428b9c20ea650a9af1e62bfbe2e371995a0df8db9f0de258) binds this object and exact owned source set. The identity sources bind a declared HUMAN, AGENT, or BOT bearer to a ROLE seat and replay retained scope, presentation, occupancy, and lifecycle records; they authenticate no bearer, issuer, clock, role authority, consent, or live occupancy. Declares an exact mechanism identity with a decision procedure (assess_identity_occupancy) and a byte-bounded recheck (recheck_identity_scope_certificate).","status":"APPLIES"}},"evidence_sets":{"sha256:4a4c9f8322ad5cde9a6b212d233095a6f73f5f54516d47bacd9117b2b303a3a8":[{"path":"src/verifier/domains/identity.py","sha256":"sha256:7e1789b4c952c487caafe26698c9c88b977a9c4dee8101c43f2bf91ec143a329"},{"path":"src/verifier/domains/contracts/identity_lifecycle.py","sha256":"sha256:efe8cf8b8d1cbc53cd272f66748794428c9c14b0e855287ea289dea9196e19db"},{"path":"src/verifier/domains/contracts/identity_lifecycle_replay.py","sha256":"sha256:67005d9834fb56747734566f36a396356e0c94e62d474528bee719c258aeb114"},{"path":"src/verifier/domains/contracts/identity_occupancy.py","sha256":"sha256:3c0cf401b5872766a5d6f7a86914a5036a364929c16f1d3adbf5f843cfa24bb4"},{"path":"src/verifier/domains/contracts/identity_presentation.py","sha256":"sha256:f5000fc720bd22e17276f398bef57c3b37dbf42c301a9698f534d64e7446f289"},{"path":"src/verifier/domains/contracts/identity_scope.py","sha256":"sha256:18aa50004e19a84be846de21e7d7ddc71c