holdings, consequence limbs, ordered transfers, delegations, revocations, forks, and accountability floor; replay establishes no legal title, lien, personhood, consent, live authority, or winning fork. Eligibility recheck binds exact request and policy, a mechanism identity and digest, and bounded evidence, returning the replayed PASS/FAIL/UNKNOWN result.","status":"APPLIES"}},"evidence_sets":{"sha256:080004625324f593771c6809312c0ca485cbcf251dde84c11f5dcebffa33c2c1":[{"path":"src/verifier/domains/contracts/owner_eligibility.py","sha256":"sha256:6d84fe13dd2957be14b9ed1065c36d762479d81bd74f0a976abfdda16401d8c9"},{"path":"src/verifier/domains/contracts/owner_forks.py","sha256":"sha256:e9bd7f4809c8968317bec45f871c0b62f694f39935051ecd892c57a8df6f0ebf"},{"path":"src/verifier/domains/contracts/owner_replay.py","sha256":"sha256:81a9087d24750a3f922b1dbca63466c5ea0de1af4a14e7a3cd272ba7771a012e"},{"path":"src/verifier/domains/owner.py","sha256":"sha256:358f5560f0b79554dcb904fdb5af1d568a5f271436dc6da73e95138e240ce22a"}],"sha256:9ab15e0ea3fb0a5819ae7bbe5a1078928776a1472bb249e3136eb639dd1a9550":[{"path":"src/verifier/domains/owner.py","sha256":"sha256:358f5560f0b79554dcb904fdb5af1d568a5f271436dc6da73e95138e240ce22a"},{"path":"src/verifier/domains/contracts/owner_eligibility.py","sha256":"sha256:6d84fe13dd2957be14b9ed1065c36d762479d81bd74f0a976abfdda16401d8c9"},{"path":"src/verifier/domains/contracts/owner_forks.py","sha256":"sha256:e9bd7f4809c8968317bec45f871c0b62f694f39935051ecd892c57a8df6f0ebf"},{"path":"src/verifier/domains/contracts/owner_replay.py","sha256":"sha256:81a9087d24750a3f922b1dbca63466c5ea0de1af4a14e7a3cd272ba7771a012e"}],"sha256:ab8854ecef28a2bde10bedb8d06df784d1658df0862aab81589382bdb94485a2":[{"path":"src/verifier/domains/owner.py","sha256":"sha256:358f5560f0b79554dcb904fdb5af1d568a5f271436dc6da73e95138e240ce22a"}]},"kind":"OWNER","object_id":"vstd-owner","obligations":{"ACTUATOR-0.1-command-to-effect":{"declaration":{"authority":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","commands":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","effect_domains":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","targets":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:ab8854ecef28a2bde10bedb8d06df784d1658df0862aab81589382bdb94485a2","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-actuator-vstd-owner-19a6d1cdc296; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"ACTUATOR-0.2-response-and-limits":{"declaration":{"limits":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","response":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","saturation":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","units_and_frames":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:ab8854ecef28a2bde10bedb8d06df784d1658df0862aab81589382bdb94485a2","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-actuator-vstd-owner-19a6d1cdc296; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"ACTUATOR-0.3-feedback-and-interlocks":{"declaration":{"effect_feedback":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","failure_states":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","interlocks":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","recovery":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:ab8854ecef28a2bde10bedb8d06df784d1658df0862aab81589382bdb94485a2","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-actuator-vstd-owner-19a6d1cdc296; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"ASSET-0.1-identity-and-quantity":{"declaration":{"identity":"The selected artifact_id and exact OWNER subject/record identify one declared holding of artifact rights and duties; this is a repository record, not proof of legal title or the external artifact's existence.","precision":"Identity is exact text/digest equality, positions and interval endpoints are exact integers, and limb inventories are finite sorted sets; no valuation, fractional title, or measurement precision is asserted.","rights":"Declared capability, consequence, and duty limbs identify the bounded rights and obligations attributed to the OWNER; labels and retained instruments do not grant real authority or prove enforceability.","units":"Units are discrete named capability/consequence/duty limbs, ownership intervals, delegates, instruments, and fork coordinates, never currency, fungible quantity, or physical inventory."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:9ab15e0ea3fb0a5819ae7bbe5a1078928776a1472bb249e3136eb639dd1a9550","reason":"OWNER sources explicitly represent one artifact's bounded rights, duties, control limbs, instruments, custody claims, transfer/delegation/revocation history, terms, and forks, so ASSET questions cannot be escaped even though external title and backing are unestablished. This exact-source Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"ASSET-0.2-issuance-and-redemption":{"declaration":{"backing_claims":"Artifact, instrument, and consequence references are declared support coordinates only. Existence, custody, legal title, economic backing, liens, and real-world control remain NOT_ESTABLISHED.","issuance_authority":"The selected genesis OWNER/instrument and replay policy declare who may originate or change the holding, but legal issuer authority, instrument custody, consent, and enforceability remain unestablished.","redemption":"No cash, token, commodity, service, or external claim redemption is implemented. Termination or transfer only changes the retained OWNER relation under the declared protocol.","supply_changes":"Transfer, delegation, revocation, freeze, seal, thaw, succession, and fork events change the retained rights/duties state; they do not create or destroy an external asset or monetary supply."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:9ab15e0ea3fb0a5819ae7bbe5a1078928776a1472bb249e3136eb639dd1a9550","reason":"OWNER sources explicitly represent one artifact's bounded rights, duties, control limbs, instruments, custody claims, transfer/delegation/revocation history, terms, and forks, so ASSET questions cannot be escaped even though external title and backing are unestablished. This exact-source Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"ASSET-0.3-custody-and-encumbrance":{"declaration":{"control":"Capability limbs and delegates delimit declared control claims; replay consistency does not prove that any command, artifact, account, or institution will honor them.","custody":"The sources retain OWNER, artifact, instrument, delegate, and event references but do not observe possession, key custody, physical custody, beneficial ownership, or third-party custody.","encumbrances":"Duties, consequence limbs, revocations, freezes, seals, terms, and forks are checked as declared constraints; external liens, competing claims, security interests, and undisclosed encumbrances remain unestablished.","reconciliation":"Exact base/end states, ordered events, instruments, and fork evidence are replayed for finite consistency. No authoritative registry, counterparty confirmation, accounting ledger, or external settlement is reconciled."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:9ab15e0ea3fb0a5819ae7bbe5a1078928776a1472bb249e3136eb639dd1a9550","reason":"OWNER sources explicitly represent one artifact's bounded rights, duties, control limbs, instruments, custody claims, transfer/delegation/revocation history, terms, and forks, so ASSET questions cannot be escaped even though external title and backing are unestablished. This exact-source Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"CONTROLLER-0.1-feedback-and-authority":{"declaration":{"authority":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","commands":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","feedback":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","objectives":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:ab8854ecef28a2bde10bedb8d06df784d1658df0862aab81589382bdb94485a2","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-controller-vstd-owner-3c07d0942a34; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"CONTROLLER-0.2-timing-and-stability":{"declaration":{"operating_envelope":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","saturation":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","stability_assumptions":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","timing":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:ab8854ecef28a2bde10bedb8d06df784d1658df0862aab81589382bdb94485a2","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-controller-vstd-owner-3c07d0942a34; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"CONTROLLER-0.3-intervention-a