itly excluded.","rights":"The record represents only a claimed capacity or reservation coordinate; ownership, exclusivity, delivered compute, physical availability, and credit authority are not established.","units":"MEMORY_BYTE and STORAGE_BYTE count bytes; COMPUTE_SLOT and SAMPLE_SLOT are dimensionless per-device reservation counts."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:57378bdacdbc86193d5ef7a092957d27d9de8fad530fb77c10b8714e8d0eb6aa","reason":"Named device records, typed capacities, and retained reservations are nonmonetary resource claims with identity, quantity, control, and backing boundaries, so ASSET declarations apply without implying ownership or physical availability. This Tier-0 declaration names the boundary only; mechanism execution and higher-tier semantic fulfillment remain unestablished."},"ASSET-0.2-issuance-and-redemption":{"declaration":{"backing_claims":"Physical device authenticity, availability, ownership, and credit backing require evidence outside this retained-record validator.","issuance_authority":"No resource asset is issued by this checker; external evidence selection supplies the claimed device inventory and capacities.","redemption":"No redemption, allocation enforcement, workload delivery, or conversion right is promised.","supply_changes":"A different retained inventory or capacity commitment is a different claim; this implementation does not mutate live supply."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:57378bdacdbc86193d5ef7a092957d27d9de8fad530fb77c10b8714e8d0eb6aa","reason":"Named device records, typed capacities, and retained reservations are nonmonetary resource claims with identity, quantity, control, and backing boundaries, so ASSET declarations apply without implying ownership or physical availability. This Tier-0 declaration names the boundary only; mechanism execution and higher-tier semantic fulfillment remain unestablished."},"ASSET-0.3-custody-and-encumbrance":{"declaration":{"control":"Accepted reservations demonstrate finite retained