or timer before delayed show or hide; render before animation-frame positioning; tool-specific pyproject tables apply only when the selected tool reads them.","failure_behavior":"A later supported browser event may render and reposition the tooltip or hide it; page reload reconstructs state. Tool failures require inspection before a separately authorized fresh build, install or test invocation.","feedback_loss":"Loss or reordering of events, delayed timers, layout changes between measurement and mutation, or DOM exceptions can leave stale or partial UI state; no safety-critical stability property is claimed.","intervention":"Cancel or schedule show/hide timers, select or clear activeLink, render content, position the tooltip, update accessibility attributes, and blur the link on Escape."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:04c9d265fa77908c4066d51b09c606f6730815babed8eca3e4837c2b0b589998","reason":"vstd-package-object applies as CONTROLLER because orientation-previews.js uses event, hover, focus, active-link and viewport feedback to schedule and command bounded show, hide, render and positioning behavior. This Tier-0 declaration names the exact reviewed source boundary only; execution, declaration truth, generated-byte freshness and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"FINBOT-0.1-agent-and-financial-authority":{"declaration":{"agent":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","decision_scope":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","financial_authority":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","harness":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:20fd2f9c0d21d1a0b84b77be1bff677a918534f64317d95b8821d4838809c664","reason":"objects.vstd APPLIES; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"FINBOT-0.2-financial-exposure-and-dependencies":{"declaration":{"assets_and_parties":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","exposure_limits":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","financial_dependencies":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","real_world_paths":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:20fd2f9c0d21d1a0b84b77be1bff677a918534f64317d95b8821d4838809c664","reason":"objects.vstd APPLIES; fulfillm