tion may come from the local collector, while resource rows are selected retained inputs bound to exact execution identifiers; their producer is not observed."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:7c94c5354ab885acab526200fb4ed34a063cf2520d26f732aec141b34325e684","reason":"env.evaluate(check=\"resources\") validates retained wall_seconds, memory_bytes, and thread observations for exact execution IDs against declared ceilings; the declaration preserves missing timestamps, authenticity, and physical-enforcement gaps. This declaration records the reviewed Tier-0 boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"MEASUREMENT-0.2-units-time-and-uncertainty":{"declaration":{"arrival_time":"The checker observes values when called but records no independent acquisition or arrival timestamp.","observation_time":"Neither collect_configuration() nor retained resource rows record an observation timestamp; temporal correspondence therefore remains unestablished.","reference_frame":"The exact selected retained-process-observations ENV, software/configuration digest, and named execution identity.","uncertainty":"No numerical uncertainty model or measurement calibration is supplied; exact-number comparison cannot establish resource-observer accuracy.","units":"Wall time is seconds, memory is bytes, and thread count is dimensionless."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:7c94c5354ab885acab526200fb4ed34a063cf2520d26f732aec141b34325e684","reason":"env.evaluate(check=\"resources\") validates retained wall_seconds, memory_bytes, and thread observations for exact execution IDs against declared ceilings; the declaration preserves missing timestamps, authenticity, and physical-enforcement gaps. This declaration records the reviewed Tier-0 boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"MEASUREMENT-0.3-validity-and-missingness":{"declaration":{"freshness":"No freshness window exists; retained configuration/resource values must 