sm truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"POLICY-0.2-authority-and-exceptions":{"declaration":{"activation":"The selected policy governs one bounded retained replay and grants no authority to start, resume, stop, or deploy a training process.","authority":"An external selector supplies the policy and trust roots for one TRAIN proposition; the checker does not authenticate training ownership or publication authority.","exceptions":"No bypass permits substituted checkpoints, unreferenced batches, noncontiguous steps, mismatched gradients, unsupported arithmetic, or a changed DATA child.","revisions":"Exact schema, semantic, mechanism, runtime-identity and source digests bind the rules; another runtime or source is a different selection."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:603e70da797a1ed6e764001c71b4d98450b056241a127db1e8354b5a960ebf7a","reason":"The TRAIN contracts select exact source, runtime, child DATA, arithmetic, tolerance and finite-limit rules and enforce contradictions or unavailability without promoting either to PASS. This exact-source Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"POLICY-0.3-enforcement-and-decisions":{"declaration":{"bypass_handling":"Missing records, altered digests, unsupported numeric conditions, tolerance violations, unused batches, and exhausted limits cannot become PASS by omission.","decision_evidence":"The certificate retains selected bytes and reports only the bounded replay outcome, runtime identity, exclusions, and exact prerequisite bindings.","enforcement_points":"Request and policy parsing, checkpoint and trace commitments, configuration validation, DATA child replay, binary64 host self-check, reduction replay, loss and update comparisons, and certificate reproduction.","unavailable_behavior":"Unsupported arithmetic, absent child evidence, incomplete records, and bounded-resource exhaustion remain UNKNOWN; they do not prove training absence or correctness."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:603e70da797a1ed6e764001c71b4d98450b056241a127db1e8354b5a960ebf7a","reason":"The TRAIN contracts select exact source, runtime, child DATA, arithmetic, tolerance and finite-limit rules and enforce contradictions or unavailability without promoting either to PASS. This exact-source Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"PROTOCOL-0.1-participants-and-states":{"declaration":{"participants":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","roles":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","states":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","transitions":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:1033cc0c64a0442eb91d06c46e6c0b3dbef7c0df1721b5192ab74f8df3a0da86","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-protocol-vstd-training-d1adaea2b13a; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"PROTOCOL-0.2-ordering-and-replay":{"declaration":{"compatibility":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","message_authority":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","ordering":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","replay":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:1033cc0c64a0442eb91d06c46e6c0b3dbef7c0df1721b5192ab74f8df3a0da86","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-protocol-vstd-training-d1adaea2b13a; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"PROTOCOL-0.3-failures-and-progress":{"declaration":{"failure_assumptions":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","liveness":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","recovery":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","safety":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:1033cc0c64a0442eb91d06c46e6c0b3dbef7c0df1721b5192ab74f8df3a0da86","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-protocol-vstd-training-d1adaea2b13a; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"ROBOT-0.1-agent-to-actuator-binding":{"declaration":{"actuators":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","agent":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","controllers":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","harness":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:1033cc0c64a0442eb91d06c46e6c0b3dbef7c0df1721b5192ab74f8df3a0da86","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-robot-vstd-training-9f4076caca9a; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"ROBOT-0.2-physical-reach-and-observation":{"declaration":{"confinement_evidence":"NOT_ESTABLISHED