WN absorption and weakest-ceiling rules with current route and child replay enforcement. This exact-source Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"POLICY-0.2-authority-and-exceptions":{"declaration":{"activation":"The policy applies to one bounded closure or child-replay certificate and does not activate the composed objects or their effects.","authority":"The external selector chooses the root, children, routes, policy and trust-root labels; the HYPER checkers cannot create authority by composition.","exceptions":"No exception drops a direct operand, substitutes a child, treats UNKNOWN as PASS, or lets the composed declaration raise its own ceiling.","revisions":"Installed registry, route, policy, mechanism and source digests bind the current composition rules; changed dependencies require re-selection."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:532faa633bc02aeeee75ca5519b8ad43d975163298674e6f257527861347ac5e","reason":"The HYPER sources install exact operand selection, closure, UNKNOWN absorption and weakest-ceiling rules with current route and child replay enforcement. This exact-source Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"POLICY-0.3-enforcement-and-decisions":{"declaration":{"bypass_handling":"Missing, duplicate, indirect, substituted, over-limit, unknown, or incompatible operands cannot be omitted or promoted to PASS.","decision_evidence":"Certificates retain the selected collection and child certificate bytes and bind each result to its target, coordinate, tier, status, and current route.","enforcement_points":"Canonical parsing, root and collection binding, finite cone construction, direct-operand matching, route selection, child replay, UNKNOWN absorption, ceiling computation, and exact recheck.","unavailable_behavior":"Unavailable child routes, evidence, policies, or bounded replay remains UNKNOWN and limits the composed result rather than being assumed absent."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:532faa633bc02aeeee75ca5519b8ad43d975163298674e6f257527861347ac5e","reason":"The HYPER sources install exact operand selection, closure, UNKNOWN absorption and weakest-ceiling rules with current route and child replay enforcement. This exact-source Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"PROTOCOL-0.1-participants-and-states":{"declaration":{"participants":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","roles":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","states":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","transitions":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:4387e04a95d099038c8ad9f1a75df40ccb5ecd9b097e721b6da85a613fa28d7b","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-protocol-vstd-hypergraph-926bec67ae40; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"PROTOCOL-0.2-ordering-and-replay":{"declaration":{"compatibility":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","message_authority":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","ordering":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","replay":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:4387e04a95d099038c8ad9f1a75df40ccb5ecd9b097e721b6da85a613fa28d7b","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-protocol-vstd-hypergraph-926bec67ae40; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"PROTOCOL-0.3-failures-and-progress":{"declaration":{"failure_assumptions":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","liveness":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","recovery":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","safety":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:4387e04a95d099038c8ad9f1a75df40ccb5ecd9b097e721b6da85a613fa28d7b","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-protocol-vstd-hypergraph-926bec67ae40; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"ROBOT-0.1-agent-to-actuator-binding":{"declaration":{"actuators":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","agent":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","controllers":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","harness":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:4387e04a95d099038c8ad9f1a75df40ccb5ecd9b097e721b6da85a613fa28d7b","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-robot-vstd-hypergraph-2c1c06460fa2; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"ROBOT-0.2-physical-reach-and-observation":{"declaration":{"confinement_evidence":"NOT_ESTABLISHED