t-bound, timeout is seconds, and retained output limits are bytes."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:3864129519655d93082bb42a32f9f5497016f294cde76bbf4b43506f78bb1c68","reason":"The HARNESS submits a command to a local process interface. This ACTUATOR role ends at launch submission and parent-visible process state; it does not establish any subject or external effect. This Tier-0 declaration names the boundary only; mechanism execution and higher-tier semantic fulfillment remain unestablished."},"ACTUATOR-0.3-feedback-and-interlocks":{"declaration":{"effect_feedback":"Only parent-visible process state and streams feed the receipt; external-effect feedback remains unobserved.","failure_states":"Prelaunch refusal, launch error, nonzero exit, timeout, partial streams, and post-processing error remain distinct.","interlocks":"Prelaunch validation, selected runner policy, source binding, cwd checks, timeout, and observation recheck gate receipt admission.","recovery":"The operator may explicitly rerun; no automatic retry, rollback, compensation, physical safe state, or guaranteed child termination is claimed."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:3864129519655d93082bb42a32f9f5497016f294cde76bbf4b43506f78bb1c68","reason":"The HARNESS submits a command to a local process interface. This ACTUATOR role ends at launch submission and parent-visible process state; it does not establish any subject or external effect. This Tier-0 declaration names the boundary only; mechanism execution and higher-tier semantic fulfillment remain unestablished."},"ASSET-0.1-identity-and-quantity":{"declaration":{"identity":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","precision":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","rights":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","units":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:714b130f574101cfac4d448e8397ec396a25bbef3a873de6e68bf893c6b94521","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-asset-vstd-harness-ce40255dbf37; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"ASSET-0.2-issuance-and-redemption":{"declaration":{"backing_claims":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","issuance_a