ained AGENT decision or tool name does not itself grant execution, physical, or financial authority.","exceptions":"No exception reconstructs unobserved channels, accepts noncontiguous steps, invents missing invocations, or treats an empty outcome contract as established.","revisions":"Current mechanism, policy, source and child-certificate digests bind the replay; historical policies are explicitly not reproduced by default."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:049b9a364dbb5712d0771268d61e2514940cb5b00ecc7119d23acc335a6ecb97","reason":"The AGENT sources derive and enforce a current HARNESS observation ceiling, exact record witnessing, trajectory order, action-to-invocation correspondence, claim support and fail-closed gaps. This exact-source Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"POLICY-0.3-enforcement-and-decisions":{"declaration":{"bypass_handling":"Uninstrumented channels, unbound records, missing tool invocations, substituted digests, unsupported checks, and over-limit evidence cannot silently pass.","decision_evidence":"A certificate binds the exact selected records and reports only bounded observation channels, step and action counts, child-policy limits, and the resulting status.","enforcement_points":"Request and policy parsing, HARNESS certificate replay, observation-ceiling derivation, record witnessing, step ordering, action-to-invocation matching, outcome comparison, claim support, and exact recheck.","unavailable_behavior":"A claim outside the observation ceiling, an empty contract, missing evidence, or unavailable child replay remains UNKNOWN rather than being inferred from surrounding records."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:049b9a364dbb5712d0771268d61e2514940cb5b00ecc7119d23acc335a6ecb97","reason":"The AGENT sources derive and enforce a current HARNESS observation ceiling, exact record witnessing, trajectory order, action-to-invocation correspondence, claim support and fail-closed gaps. This exact-source Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"PROTOCOL-0.1-participants-and-states":{"declaration":{"participants":"The vstd-agent verifier retains PROTOCOL.participants as a Tier-0 obligation because the sole authored reasons.vstd selects conservative APPLIES while the owned closed-effect boundary is open. The concrete mechanism value and any external occurrence remain NOT_ESTABLISHED.","roles":"The vstd-agent verifier retains PROTOCOL.roles as a Tier-0 obligation because the sole authored reasons.vstd selects conservative APPLIES while the owned closed-effect boundary is open. The concrete mechanism value and any external occurrence remain NOT_ESTABLISHED.","states":"The vstd-agent verifier retains PROTOCOL.states as a Tier-0 obligation because the sole authored reasons.vstd selects conservative APPLIES while the owned closed-effect boundary is open. The concrete mechanism value and any external occurrence remain NOT_ESTABLISHED.","transitions":"The vstd-agent verifier retains PROTOCOL.transitions as a Tier-0 obligation because the sole authored reasons.vstd selects conservative APPLIES while the owned closed-effect boundary is open. The concrete mechanism value and any external occurrence remain NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:049b9a364dbb5712d0771268d61e2514940cb5b00ecc7119d23acc335a6ecb97","reason":"The sole authored reasons.vstd conservatively selects APPLIES for vstd-agent as PROTOCOL so every PROTOCOL obligation remains required while the owned closed-effect boundary is open. This obligation-retention decision is distinct from source-role evidence and establishes neither a concrete mechanism, authority, external effect, occurrence, checker PASS, nor Tier-1-plus fulfillment. This exact-source Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"PROTOCOL-0.2-ordering-and-replay":{"declaration":{"compatibili