annel contracts.","effect_domains":"SIMULATED_MODEL_ONLY; no physical actuator, real-money transfer, external service, or sim-to-real route is declared.","targets":"Only the selected model state and simulated action channels inside the finite SIM representation."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:1983450e3fa19a5561e1566e60d2d8731bdb7c85d273dfcf58e57a7b532590ec","reason":"The SIM channel check accepts only retained simulated actions bounded by the model contract. Its targets are model state and simulated channels, never physical actuators. This Tier-0 declaration names the boundary only; mechanism execution and higher-tier semantic fulfillment remain unestablished."},"ACTUATOR-0.2-response-and-limits":{"declaration":{"limits":"Finite state, item, operation, action-bound, trajectory, and subprocess ceilings constrain the check.","response":"The deterministic transition function maps selected state and entropy to the next simulated state; retained channels are compared exactly.","saturation":"Out-of-bound retained actions refute; the implementation does not silently clamp or claim a physical saturation response.","units_and_frames":"Action values use the supplied model contract's numeric variables, bounds, and causal-step coordinate."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:1983450e3fa19a5561e1566e60d2d8731bdb7c85d273dfcf58e57a7b532590ec","reason":"The SIM channel check accepts only retained simulated actions bounded by the model contract. Its targets are model state and simulated channels, never physical actuators. This Tier-0 declaration names the boundary only; mechanism execution and higher-tier semantic fulfillment remain unestablished."},"ACTUATOR-0.3-feedback-and-interlocks":{"declaration":{"effect_feedback":"Subsequent simulated state and declared observation projections are model feedback, not evidence of a real-world effect.","failure_states":"Malformed, out-of-bound, inconsistent, unavailable, or timed-out simulation inputs cannot yield an admitted effect claim.","interlocks":"Exact source/request/policy bindings, finite bounds, channel coverage, and worker validation interlock admission of the model result.","recovery":"A caller may perform a fresh bounded replay; no physical safe state, rollback, or external compensation is claimed."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:1983450e3fa19a5561e1566e60d2d8731bdb7c85d273dfcf58e57a7b532590ec","reason":"The SIM channel check accepts only retained simulated actions bounded by the model contract. Its targets are model state and simulated channels, never physical actuators. This Tier-0 declaration names the boundary only; mechanism execution and higher-tier semantic fulfillment remain unestablished."},"ASSET-0.1-identity-and-quantity":{"declaration":{"identity":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","precision":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","rights":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","units":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:e1e88b099b9ef8332c53780d0565104ab2b721b8fbbb207ff7038250a558b93c","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-asset-vstd-simulation-00d1a9279544; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"ASSET-0.2-issuance-and-redemption":{"declaration":{"backing_claims":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","issuance_authority":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","redemption":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","supply_changes":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:e1e88b099b9ef8332c53780d0565104ab2b721b8fbbb207ff7038250a558b93c","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-asset-vstd-simulation-00d1a9279544; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"ASSET-0.3-custody-and-encumbrance":{"declaration":{"control":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","custody":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","encumbrances":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","reconciliation":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:e1e88b099b9ef8332c53780d0565104ab2b721b8fbbb207ff7038250a558b93c","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-asset-vstd-simulation-00d1a9279544; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"CONTROLLER-0.1-feedback-and-authority":{"declaration":{"authority":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","commands":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","feedback":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","objectives":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:e1e88