ion boundary, so HARDWARE effects are not proved unreachable. The sole reasons.vstd retains HARDWARE; no such effect, authority or checker PASS is claimed.","status":"APPLIES"},"HARNESS":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:aaed676c2b70e551fca2b4893815973069508ab3e7b8976dae0d50f1ad1b85c8","reason":"Audited original-kind profile verifier-package-original-kind-retained-partial revision 2 (sha256:05f910901fae9778428b9c20ea650a9af1e62bfbe2e371995a0df8db9f0de258) binds this object and exact owned source set. The token sources replay one capability-token holding, tenure, leases, caveats, signatures, and fresh status under checker-admitted keys; a valid token signature names an issuing key but never grants real authority or proves external identity. token_checks.py:427 crosses the imported VerificationSession evaluation boundary, so HARNESS effects are not proved unreachable. The sole reasons.vstd retains HARNESS; no such effect, authority or checker PASS is claimed.","status":"APPLIES"},"HUMAN":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:aaed676c2b70e551fca2b4893815973069508ab3e7b8976dae0d50f1ad1b85c8","reason":"Audited original-kind profile verifier-package-original-kind-retained-partial revision 2 (sha256:05f910901fae9778428b9c20ea650a9af1e62bfbe2e371995a0df8db9f0de258) binds this object and exact owned source set. The token sources replay one capability-token holding, tenure, leases, caveats, signatures, and fresh status under checker-admitted keys; a valid token signature names an issuing key but never grants real authority or proves external identity. token_checks.py:427 crosses the imported VerificationSession evaluation boundary, so HUMAN effects are not proved unreachable. The sole reasons.vstd retains HUMAN; no such effect, authority or checker PASS is claimed.","status":"APPLIES"},"HYPER":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:aaed676c2b70e551fca2b4893815973069508ab3e7b8976dae0d50f1ad1b85c8","reason":"Audited original-kind profile verifier-package-original-kind-retained-partial revision 2 (sha256:05f910901fae9778428b9c20ea650a9af1e62bfbe2e371995a0df8db9f0de258) binds this object and exact owned source set. The token sources replay one capability-token holding, tenure, leases, caveats, signatures, and fresh status under checker-admitted keys; a valid token signature names an issuing key but never grants real authority or proves external identity. Directed parent-grant edges form a dependency cone to the birth token, each lease scope ceiling is its parent's scopes, and unsupported gaps are absorbed as UNKNOWN; named operands are an admission gap.","status":"APPLIES"},"IDENTITY":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:aaed676c2b70e551fca2b4893815973069508ab3e7b8976dae0d50f1ad1b85c8","reason":"Audited original-kind profile verifier-package-original-kind-retained-partial revision 2 (sha256:05f910901fae9778428b9c20ea650a9af1e62bfbe2e371995a0df8db9f0de258) binds this object and exact owned source set. The token sources replay one capability-token holding, tenure, leases, caveats, signatures, and fresh status under checker-admitted keys; a valid token signature names an issuing key but never grants real authority or proves external identity. Lifetime leases bind a delegate key or an absent confirmation key to permitted scopes, with validity, status and accrued-tenure lifecycle; bearer eligibility is computed from these fields.","status":"APPLIES"},"LEDGER":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","reason":"UNRESOLVED.","status":"UNRESOLVED"},"MARKET":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:90270fd3b96afed5564e1b079836e90a88d60a955501e614720ed35f73445538","reason":"Capability scopes and delegation are not orders, prices, matching, participant market access, allocation, manipulation control or trade settlement.","status":"DOES_NOT_APPLY"},"MEASUREMENT":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:90270fd3b96afed5564e1b079836e90a88d60a955501e614720ed35f73445538","reason":"Epoch, clock, window, skew and status integers are supplied retained protocol records checked for consistency, not fresh measurements of an external phenomenon.","status":"DOES_NOT_APPLY"},"MODEL":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:aaed676c2b70e551fca2b4893815973069508ab3e7b8976dae0d50f1ad1b85c8","reason":"Audited original-kind profile verifier-package-original-kind-retained-partial revision 2 (sha256:05f910901fae9778428b9c20ea650a9af1e62bfbe2e371995a0df8db9f0de258) binds this object and exact owned source set. The token sources replay one capability-token holding, tenure, leases, caveats, signatures, and fresh status under checker-admitted keys; a valid token signature names an issuing key but never grants real authority or proves external identity. token_checks.py:427 crosses the imported VerificationSession evaluation boundary, so MODEL effects are not proved unreachable. The sole reasons.vstd retains MODEL; no such effect, authority or checker PASS is claimed.","status":"APPLIES"},"OWNER":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:aaed676c2b70e551fca2b4893815973069508ab3e7b8976dae0d50f1ad1b85c8","reason":"Audited original-kind profile verifier-package-original-kind-retained-partial revision 2 (sha256:05f910901fae9778428b9c20ea650a9af1e62bfbe2e371995a0df8db9f0de258) binds this object and exact owned source set. The token sources replay one capability-token holding, tenure, leases, caveats, signatures, and fresh status under checker-admitted keys; a valid token signature names an issuing key but never grants real authority or proves external identity. token_checks.py:427 crosses the imported VerificationSession evaluation boundary, so OWNER effects are not proved unreachable. The sole reasons.vstd retains OWNER; no such effect, authority or checker PASS is claimed.","status":"APPLIES"},"POLICY":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:90270fd3b96afed5564e1b079836e90a88d60a955501e614720ed35f73445538","reason":"The TOKEN sources apply externally selected keys, algorithms, trust roots, scope attenuation, caveats, windows, replay ids, clock skew, status freshness and finite limits without turning a signature into authority.","status":"APPLIES"},"PROTOCOL":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:90270fd3b96afed5564e1b079836e90a88d60a955501e614720ed35f73445538","reason":"TOKEN birth, aging, lease delegation, signature, audience, window and status records define participant roles, ordered state transitions, replay resistance, compatibility and fail-closed progress boundaries.","status":"APPLIES"},"RECEIPT":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:aaed676c2b70e551fca2b4893815973069508ab3e7b8976dae0d50f1ad1b85c8","reason":"Audited original-kind profile verifier-package-original-kind-retained-partial revision 2 (sha256:05f910901fae9778428b9c20ea650a9af1e62bfbe2e371995a0df8db9f0de258) binds this object and exact owned source set. The token sources replay one capability-token holding, tenure, leases, caveats, signatures, and fresh status under checker-admitted keys; a valid token signature names an issuing key but never grants real authority or proves external identity. The certificate binds the request subject, mechanism and proposition digests and retained evidence, and its replay must reproduce the bytes exactly; a separate OBJECT subject and HARDWARE operand are admission gaps.","status":"APPLIES"},"ROBOT":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","reason":"UNRESOLVED.","status":"UNRESOLVED"},"ROLE":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:aaed676c2b70e551fca2b4893815973069508ab3e7b8976dae0d50f1ad1b85c8","reason":"Audited original-kind profile verifier-package-original-kind-retained-partial revision 2 (sha256:05f910901fae9778428b9c20ea650a9af1e62bfbe2e371995a0df8db9f0de258) binds this object and exact owned source set. The token sources replay one capability-token holding, tenure, leases, caveats, signatures, and fresh status under checker-admitted keys; a valid token signature names an issuing key but never grants real authority or proves external identity. token_checks.py:427 crosses the imported VerificationSession evaluation boundary, so ROLE effects are not proved unreachable. The sole reasons.vstd retains ROLE; no such effect, authority or checker PASS is claimed.","status":"APPLIES"},"SENSOR":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:90270fd3b96afed5564e1b079836e90a88d60a955501e614720ed35f73445538","reason":"The TOKEN sources acquire no live key, status service, clock or application observation; absent or stale retained status remains UNKNOWN rather than sensor output.","status":"DOES_NOT_APPLY"},"SIM":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:aaed676c2b70e551fca2b4893815973069508ab3e7b8976dae0d50f1ad1b85c8","reason":"Audited original-kind profile verifier-package-original-kind-retained-partial revision 2 (sha256:05f910901fae9778428b9c20ea650a9af1e62bfbe2e371995a0df8db9f0de258) binds this object and exact owned source set. The token sources replay one capability-token holding, tenure, leases, caveats, signatures, and fresh status under checker-admitted keys; a valid token signature names an issuing key but never grants real authority or proves external identity. token_checks.py:427 crosses the imported VerificationSession evaluation boundary, so SIM effects are not proved unreachable. The sole reasons.vstd retains SIM; no such effect, authority or checker PASS is claimed.","status":"APPLIES"},"SPACE":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:aaed676c2b70e551fca2b4893815973069508ab3e7b8976dae0d50f1ad1b85c8","reason":"Audited original-kind profile verifier-package-original-kind-retained-partial revision 2 (sha256:05f910901fae9778428b9c20ea650a9af1e62bfbe2e371995a0df8db9f0de258) binds this object and exact owned source set. The token sources replay one capability-token holding, tenure, leases, caveats, signatures, and fresh status under checker-admitted keys; a valid token signature names an issuing key but never grants real authority or proves external identity. token_checks.py:427 crosses the imported VerificationSession evaluation boundary, so SPACE effects are not proved unreachable. The sole reasons.vstd retains SPACE; no such effect, authority or checker PASS is claimed.","status":"APPLIES"},"TIME":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:aaed676c2b70e551fca2b4893815973069508ab3e7b8976dae0d50f1ad1b85c8","reason":"Audited original-kind profile verifier-package-original-kind-retained-partial revision 2 (sha256:05f910901fae9778428b9c20ea650a9af1e62bfbe2e371995a0df8db9f0de258) binds this object and exact owned source set. The token sources replay one capability-token holding, tenure, leases, caveats, signatures, and fresh status under checker-admitted keys; a valid token signature names an issuing key but never grants real authority or proves external identity. Lifetime windows and issuance instants are integers on one named clock, ordered against the birth token and the retained epoch sequence.","status":"APPLIES"},"TOKEN":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:aaed676c2b70e551fca2b4893815973069508ab3e7b8976dae0d50f1ad1b85c8","reason":"Audited original-kind profile verifier-package-original-kind-retained-partial revision 2 (sha256:05f910901fae9778428b9c20ea650a9af1e62bfbe2e371995a0df8db9f0de258) binds this object and exact owned source set. The token sources replay one capability-token holding, tenure, leases, caveats, signatures, and fresh status under checker-admitted keys; a valid token signature names an issuing key but never grants real authority or proves external identity. The holding replay covers issuing-key binding, lifetime scope, tenure epochs, leases and status, matching TOKEN issuance-key, scope, tenure, lease and status semantics.","status":"APPLIES"},"TRAIN":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:aaed676c2b70e551fca2b4893815973069508ab3e7b8976dae0d50f1ad1b85c8","reason":"Audited original-kind profile verifier-package-original-kind-retained-partial revision 2 (sha256:05f910901fae9778428b9c20ea650a9af1e62bfbe2e371995a0df8db9f0de258) binds this object and exact owned source set. The token sources replay one capability-token holding, tenure, leases, caveats, signatures, and fresh status under checker-admitted keys; a valid token signature names an issuing key but never grants real authority or proves external identity. token_checks.py:427 crosses the imported VerificationSession evaluation boundary, so TRAIN effects are not proved unreachable. The sole reasons.vstd retains TRAIN; no such effect, authority or checker PASS is claimed.","status":"APPLIES"},"TRANSACTION":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:90270fd3b96afed5564e1b079836e90a88d60a955501e614720ed35f73445538","reason":"The checker neither issues, delegates, redeems, revokes, transfers nor consumes a token and commits no application effect; it only replays immutable selected records.","status":"DOES_NOT_APPLY"},"VERIFIER":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:aaed676c2b70e551fca2b4893815973069508ab3e7b8976dae0d50f1ad1b85c8","reason":"Audited original-kind profile verifier-package-original-kind-retained-partial revision 2 (sha256:05f910901fae9778428b9c20ea650a9af1e62bfbe2e371995a0df8db9f0de258) binds this object and exact owned source set. The token sources replay one capability-token holding, tenure, leases, caveats, signatures, and fresh status under checker-admitted keys; a valid token signature names an issuing key but never grants real authority or proves external identity. Defines an exact mechanism identity with a PASS/FAIL/UNKNOWN decision procedure, budget-bounded replay of the retained inventory, and certificate recheck.","status":"APPLIES"}},"evidence_sets":{"sha256:4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945":[],"sha256:90270fd3b96afed5564e1b079836e90a88d60a955501e614720ed35f73445538":[{"path":"src/verifier/domains/token.py","sha256":"sha256:b5435e82e844e85eccad28a69f2cee8b3d58bb0dd9d083532f2227b5dae2cdd6"},{"path":"src/verifier/domains/contracts/token_checks.py","sha256":"sha256:bc3b900da75a2ead7bce66f04287bc9c240138195a04b8c3fd67417fdd1efd77"},{"path":"src/verifier/domains/contracts/token_checks_projection.py","sha256":"sha256:a5a06112affc