 this primitive does not authenticate an external authority channel.","effects":"Provision tables, insert one issuance, or advance the configured epoch in one local database.","preconditions":"Validate host selection, exact proposal digest, epoch, uniqueness and resource bounds before commit.","resources":"One configured local SQLite database and its journal; no network or distributed transaction."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:1ef3036ee28f69068bd4528a7a11241521229a42d543cc1767590c3d090e9423","reason":"The owned source implements the local TRANSACTION boundary described by the named declarations. This Tier-0 declaration names the boundary only; mechanism execution and higher-tier semantic fulfillment remain unestablished."},"TRANSACTION-0.2-commit-and-failure":{"declaration":{"abort":"ROLLBACK the active transaction on an exception or known replay.","commit":"BEGIN IMMEDIATE followed by COMMIT, with synchronous=FULL; construct the bounded receipt before commit.","finality":"A returned local commit receipt is not worldwide finality or public historical execution.","partial_failure":"Cancellation, storage errors and uncertain commit remain UNKNOWN; the caller must recheck, not infer non-consumption."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:1ef3036ee28f69068bd4528a7a11241521229a42d543cc1767590c3d090e9423","reason":"The owned source implements the local TRANSACTION boundary described by the named declarations. This Tier-0 declaration names the boundary only; mechanism execution and higher-tier semantic fulfillment remain unestablished."},"TRANSACTION-0.3-retry-and-replay":{"declaration":{"duplicate_detection":"UNIQUE invocation_id plus an explicit existing-row check within the transaction.","idempotency":"Repeated consumption is rejected, not issued again; read-only recheck is separate.","replay":"Exact local row replay only, with current selection, policy epoch and mechanism binding.","retry_limits":"No automatic consumption retry; SQLite busy waiting is bounded by MAX_BUSY_SECONDS."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:1ef3036ee28f69068bd4528a7a11241521229a42d543cc1767590c3d090e9423","reason":"The owned source implements the local TRANSACTION boundary described by the named declarations. This Tier-0 declaration names the boundary only; mechanism execution and higher-tier semantic fulfillment remain unestablished."}},"operands":{},"payload":{"representation_role":"Host-selected local invocation-consumption ledger, bounded SQLite control experiments and fixed parent/worker execution adapter."},"reason":"The same source owns authoritative local consumption history, transaction guards, admission policy and a versioned parent/worker JSON exchange, so those consequential roles must accumulate on one exact owner. Boundary: One host-provisioned nonmonetary local SQLite ledger and fresh temporary worker experiments only; no actor authentication, external authority, delivery proof, automatic retry, liveness guarantee, distributed or financial accounting, public history, or global finality.","specializations":["POLICY","PROTOCOL","TRANSACTION"],"surfaces":["file:src/verifier/runtime/local_ledger_control_checks.py","python:src/verifier/runtime/local_ledger_control_checks.py:<module>","python:src/verifier/runtime/local_ledger_control_checks.py:_closed_local_receipt","python:src/verifier/runtime/local_ledger_control_checks.py:_entry","python:src/verifier/runtime/local_ledger_control_checks.py:_first_state","python:src/verifier/runtime/local_ledger_control_checks.py:_result","python:src/verifier/runtime/local_ledger_control_checks.py:_same","python:src/verifier/runtime/local_ledger_control_checks.py:_integrity","python:src/verifier/runtime/local_ledger_control_checks.py:check_control","file:src/verifier/runtime/local_ledger_controls.py","python:src/verifier/runtime/local_ledger_controls.py:<module>","python:src/verifier/runtime/local_ledger_controls.py:_digest","python:src/verifier/runtime/local_ledger_controls.py:_proposal","python:src/verifier/runtime/loc