5; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"TRANSACTION-0.1-effects-and-authority":{"declaration":{"authorization":"Explicit CLI invocation and local filesystem permissions; no publication or semantic admission authority.","effects":"Template exclusive-create or explicit formatter replacement of the selected manifest file.","preconditions":"Template refuses an existing target; formatter requires strict portable JSON and unchanged original bytes.","resources":"Selected manifest and same-directory unpublished temporary file."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:08a11df297c367fb3660f621ba2cb234b60d283f13d26e79fdd9fd7d4a84779f","reason":"The owned source implements the local TRANSACTION boundary described by the named declarations. This Tier-0 declaration names the boundary only; mechanism execution and higher-tier semantic fulfillment remain unestablished."},"TRANSACTION-0.2-commit-and-failure":{"declaration":{"abort":"Exceptions propagate; formatter removes only its own unpublished temporary file.","commit":"Template writes through exclusive creation; formatter publishes via os.replace after a source-byte recheck.","finality":"Filesystem publication only; no power-loss durability, cross-process lock or global atomicity guarantee is claimed.","partial_failure":"Template write failure can leave a partial new file; a writer racing after the formatter recheck is not excluded by a lock."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:08a11df297c367fb3660f621ba2cb234b60d283f13d26e79fdd9fd7d4a84779f","reason":"The owned source implements the local TRANSACTION boundary described by the named declarations. This Tier-0 declaration names the boundary only; mechanism execution and higher-tier semantic fulfillment remain unestablished."},"TRANSACTION-0.3-retry-and-replay":{"declaration":{"duplicate_detection":"Exclusive create rejects duplicate template publication; formatting checks original bytes before replacement.","idempotency":"Canonical formatting is content-idempotent; template creation is intentionall