ncial endpoint participates in checker execution; an actual financial AGENT and HARNESS binding are NOT_ESTABLISHED.","decision_scope":"Select one of nine exact source-registered MARKET, ROBOT, or FINBOT propositions and construct or independently recheck its bounded retained-byte certificate without executing the represented subject; for POLICY observations, launch one exact isolated local worker and retain its bounded response. The applicable ASSET boundary retains an obligation-bearing FINBOT consequence role without promoting a represented financial effect.","financial_authority":"Installed route and policy code select the proposition, checker, limits, and nonpromotion boundary and authorize only the named local worker launch. Caller-supplied trust-root labels and retained records grant no venue, physical, legal, publication, or release authority; actual financial authority is NOT_ESTABLISHED.","harness":"Exact policy, request, proposition, source, mechanism, and evidence digests are checked before strict canonical-JSON decoding; the selected finite domain evaluator and installed consequence-graph engine produce a typed result, and recheck rebuilds the complete self-digested certificate byte for byte. POLICY observation acquisition launches the installed worker as python -I -S -B, sends one nonce-bound request, and verifies its return status, schema, nonce, and source pins."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:e073587b46d44f9dd79dd9bf9af9bddc0725bcaaad76466856722e70dfb2e081","reason":"added-kind retained-evidence VERIFIER applies as FINBOT. Its applicable ASSET boundary is reached by the same source-bound certificate route, so effect-first classification retains FINBOT obligations while actual agency, authority, endpoints, exposure, financial effects, and reconciliation remain NOT_ESTABLISHED. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"FINBOT-0.2-financial-exposure-and-dependencie