 current source-byte denominator: src/verifier/corrigibility/ontology.py. Fixed operands: none. Necessity: Ontology composition applies explicit classification policy to inert structural records and must not inherit behavioral roles from the names it represents. Consequence boundary: The records execute no AGENT or BOT, create no confinement, and establish no ROBOT, FINBOT, physical, or financial consequence. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed exact-source boundary only; mechanism execution, semantic truth, and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"POLICY-0.2-authority-and-exceptions":{"declaration":{"activation":"vstd-agent-bot-ontology-architecture declaration basis sha256:8ff65904f1403c35069dfee9a7291c85928865d512a83582e8d75b14f7fdd14a binds exact source src/verifier/corrigibility/ontology.py; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-agent-bot-ontology-architecture (Computational SPACE, TIME, EVENT, AGENT, and BOT ontology record architecture.) includes only states explicitly represented by the owned sources; unobserved runtime or external states remain UNKNOWN.","authority":"vstd-agent-bot-ontology-architecture declaration basis sha256:8ff65904f1403c35069dfee9a7291c85928865d512a83582e8d75b14f7fdd14a binds exact source src/verifier/corrigibility/ontology.py; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-agent-bot-ontology-architecture (Computational SPACE, TIME, EVENT, AGENT, and BOT ontology record architecture.) has only caller invocation and source-declared authority. Ownership review grants no human, legal, physical, financial, or release authority.","exceptions":"vstd-agent-bot-ontology-architecture declaration basis sha256:8ff65904f1403c35069dfee9a7291c85928865d512a83582e8d75b14f7fdd14a binds exact sou