 configured Ed25519 key material, and the verification routine in the same module participate.","roles":"Local preservation of exact file or directory bytes through freeze, optional Ed25519 seal, verification, and copy-on-write thaw operations.","states":"The represented states are source selected, freeze staged, frozen, verified, sealed, thawed descendant, or refused with retained parent unchanged.","transitions":"Freeze must complete before verification or sealing; seals close one verified freeze; thaw creates a new descendant and never mutates the frozen parent."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:d2bbbc0aa56de7608031efbce1bc9bef24b59c05b233ea1ae646f7cebf2e7077","reason":"The artifact freeze/seal/thaw lifecycle applies as PROTOCOL. Its named participants, ordered states and transitions, compatibility, replay, failure, progress, and recovery form a protocol boundary; a network or cross-process exchange is not inferred unless declared. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"PROTOCOL-0.2-ordering-and-replay":{"declaration":{"compatibility":"Canonical JSON, SHA-256 and SHA3-256 identities, exclusive staging/rename, portable read-only guards, and finite Ed25519 seal records implement the local lifecycle.","message_authority":"Authority is limited to the local caller's path access and explicitly supplied signing key; a valid seal establishes neither ownership nor authorization.","ordering":"Freeze must complete before verification or sealing; seals close one verified freeze; thaw creates a new descendant and never mutates the frozen parent.","replay":"Existing destinations and conflicting seal identities refuse rather than overwrite; a retry is a fresh verification and explicitly selected new operation."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:d2bbbc0aa56de7608031efbce1bc9bef24b59c05b233ea1ae646f7cebf2e7077","reason":"The artifact freeze/seal/thaw lifecycle applies as PROTOCOL. Its named participants, ordered states and transitions, compatibility, replay, failure, progress, and recovery form a protocol boundary; a network or cross-process exchange is not inferred unless declared. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"PROTOCOL-0.3-failures-and-progress":{"declaration":{"failure_assumptions":"Malformed records, path escape, special files, source drift, digest or signature mismatch, guard failure, collision, or write error refuses the selected transition.","liveness":"The implementation records declared lifecycle times but establishes no freshness, distributed ordering, or real-time completion guarantee.","recovery":"Recovery requires correcting the local source, key, record, guard, or destination and starting a new operation; accepted history is not silently rewritten.","safety":"Paths, ordinary-file rules, canonical records, digest equality, read-only guards, key form, and absent destinations bound accepted operations."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:d2bbbc0aa56de7608031efbce1bc9bef24b59c05b233ea1ae646f7cebf2e7077","reason":"The artifact freeze/seal/thaw lifecycle applies as PROTOCOL. Its named participants, ordered states and transitions, compatibility, replay, failure, progress, and recovery form a protocol boundary; a network or cross-process exchange is not inferred unless declared. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"ROBOT-0.1-agent-to-actuator-binding":{"declaration":{"actuators":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","agent":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","controllers":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","harness":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:7e5e1edfec5f15feb9a54d5430e1b2e8f01606b6a073a08f3d20dc9ad2f4741c","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-robot-vstd-artifact-control-lifecycle-8de61fcd0bba; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"ROBOT-0.2-physical-reach-and-observation":{"declaration":{"confinement_evide