TOCOL","object_id":"vstd-artifact-trace-protocol","obligations":{"ACTUATOR-0.1-command-to-effect":{"declaration":{"authority":"vstd-artifact-trace-protocol declaration basis sha256:358f356edc71e34e5bc41eb65ea8113056a02d0969098b43c1ccfabbe80e5d99 binds exact source src/verifier/hardware/tracers.py; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-artifact-trace-protocol (Entropy and carrier callback protocol with recorded trace observations and effects.) has only caller invocation and source-declared authority. Ownership review grants no human, legal, physical, financial, or release authority.","commands":"vstd-artifact-trace-protocol declaration basis sha256:358f356edc71e34e5bc41eb65ea8113056a02d0969098b43c1ccfabbe80e5d99 binds exact source src/verifier/hardware/tracers.py; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-artifact-trace-protocol (Entropy and carrier callback protocol with recorded trace observations and effects.) can submit only calls, callbacks, decisions, or records implemented by its owned sources; downstream effects require separate evidence.","effect_domains":"vstd-artifact-trace-protocol declaration basis sha256:358f356edc71e34e5bc41eb65ea8113056a02d0969098b43c1ccfabbe80e5d99 binds exact source src/verifier/hardware/tracers.py; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-artifact-trace-protocol (Entropy and carrier callback protocol with recorded trace observations and effects.) is bounded to declared software effects. No physical or real-money effect domain is inferred from source ownership.","targets":"vstd-artifact-trace-protocol declaration basis sha256:358f356edc71e34e5bc41eb65ea8113056a02d09690