SHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:591caa2f4c39292054446f2405f2b5961b6285c0655a9e4f586416c15dab807d","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-sensor-vstd-assurance-event-ledger-9f2e17f25f5f; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"TRANSACTION-0.1-effects-and-authority":{"declaration":{"authorization":"The direct caller invokes mutation and supplies actors or mechanisms; recorded identities and evidence do not independently authenticate real-world authority.","effects":"Record methods append one event or a staged related group and may append one conflict resolution to in-process AssuranceLedger state.","preconditions":"The historical graph must remain unchanged and referenced subjects, mechanisms, evidence, prerequisites, conflicts, and current-state relations must be admissible.","resources":"Resources are one ledger instance, its immutable graph snapshot, current event/resolution lists, and bounded caller-supplied evidence payloads."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:591caa2f4c39292054446f2405f2b5961b6285c0655a9e4f586416c15dab807d","reason":"Its record methods mutate the retained prefix, and grouped guilt recording explicitly stages related evidence to avoid partial ledger commit while detecting exporter-induced graph mutation before the group append. This source-bound Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"TRANSACTION-0.2-commit-and-failure":{"declaration":{"abort":"Invalid graph state, references, conflicts, prerequisites, mechanism results, or evidence export raises before the corresponding retained event append where the method specifies.","commit":"A single record commits when its event is appended. Grouped guilt establishment stages all payloads before appending its required event group.","finality":"Committed events are append-only for that in-memory ledger prefix; this is not durable, externally witnessed, or globally authoritative finality.","partial_failure":"Caller-supplied evidence exporters may have effects before the staged ledger append; the source explicitly avoids an unreplayable partial event prefix but cannot roll back exporter effects."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:591caa2f4c39292054446f2405f2b5961b6285c0655a9e4f586416c15dab807d","reason":"Its record methods mutate the retained prefix, and grouped guilt recording explicitly stages related evidence to avoid partial ledger commit while detecting exporter-induced graph mutation before the group append. This source-bound Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"TRANSACTION-0.3-retry-and-replay":{"declaration":{"duplicate_detection":"Event digests, existing current state, conflict identities, and prerequisite relations detect some repeats; not every record method promises request-id idempotency.","idempotency":"Replay validation is deterministic, but mutation calls must be retried only after inspecting retained state because a completed append is not generically deduplicated by invocation id.","replay":"A serialized valid prefix can be replayed to the same current state; replay re-executes the caller-supplied mechanisms (data/assurance.py:1816-1821), does not repeat caller exporter effects, and does not prove recorded mechanism observations true.","retry_limits":"The module supplies no automatic retry or backoff. The caller must bound evidence mechanisms and stop on an ambiguous exporter or append outcome."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:591caa2f4c39292054446f2405f2b5961b6285c0655a9e4f586416c15dab807d","reason":"Its record methods mutate the retained prefix, and grouped guilt recording explicitly stages related evidence to avoid partial ledger commit while detecting exporter-induced graph mutation before the group append. This source-bound Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."}},"operands":{},"payload":{"representation_role":"Append-only assurance events, conflicts, applicability decisions and challenge projections."},"reason":"Assurance conclusions depend on authoritative event ordering and retained conflicts that generic DATA ownership would conceal. Its record methods mutate the retained prefix, and grouped guilt recording explicitly stages related evidence to avoid partial ledger commit while detecting exporter-induced graph mutation before the group append. Boundary: This records assurance state only; it is not an asset ledger and creates no monetary claim or backing.","specializations":["TRANSACTION"],"surfaces":["file:src/verifier/data/assurance.py","python:src/verifier/data/assurance.py:<module>","python:src/verifier/data/assurance.py:AssuranceFlowError","python:src/verifier/data/assurance.py:AssuranceEventKind","python:src/verifier/data/assurance.py:DiagnosticKind","python:src/verifier/data/assurance.py:ObligationCoordinate","python:src/verifier/data/assurance.py:ObligationCoordinate.__post_init__","python:src/verifier/data/assurance.py:ObligationCoordinate.to_dict","python:src/verifier/data/assurance.py:ObligationCoordinate.digest","python:src/verifier/data/assurance.py:ObligationCoordinate.from_dict","python:src/verifier/data/assurance.py:ChallengeProjectionMechanism","python:src/verifier/data/assurance.py:ChallengeProjectionMechanism.evaluate","python:src/verifier/data/assurance.py:_status_from_challenge_records","python:src/verifier/data/assurance.py:AssuranceEvent","python:src/verifier/data/assurance.py:AssuranceEvent.payload","python:src/verifier/data/assurance.py:AssuranceEvent.digest","python:src/verifier/data/assurance.py:AssuranceEvent.to_dict","python:src/verifier/data/assurance.py:ConflictResolution","python:src/verifier/data/assurance.py:ConflictResolution.to_dict","python:src/verifier/data/assurance.py:StructuralConcentration","python:src/verifier/data/assurance.py:StructuralConcentration.count","python:src/verifier/data/assurance.py:StructuralConcentration.to_dict","python:src/verifier/data/assurance.py:Diagnostic