n one push, upload content-addressed objects, finalize the push, and submit one claim candidate through the explicit Claim Garden client states.","states":"Registration, open push, unique object storage, finalized push, and claim-candidate PENDING_REVIEW states are distinct and exact.","transitions":"Registration precedes authenticated work; a push is opened before object upload and finalized after uploads; claim submission follows its exact head and object bindings."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:2eeae4eff8ed693b3c87cb63f1a0bc37ca5e7ea1058dd130f21311e96dd98dd2","reason":"Claim Garden lifecycle applies as PROTOCOL. Its participants exchange ordered requests/responses across a process or remote boundary with explicit compatibility and failure states. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"PROTOCOL-0.2-ordering-and-replay":{"declaration":{"compatibility":"Canonical finite JSON over exact HTTPS origins with redirects disabled, bounded response reads, exact response fields, and source-level state checks.","message_authority":"The caller explicitly selects the endpoint and operation; the endpoint accepts a registered bearer credential. Neither establishes legal, moderation, publication, or financial authority.","ordering":"Registration precedes authenticated work; a push is opened before object upload and finalized after uploads; claim submission follows its exact head and object bindings.","replay":"The client performs no automatic retry after a transport attempt; exact content identities and server deduplication fields are checked where the protocol exposes them."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:2eeae4eff8ed693b3c87cb63f1a0bc37ca5e7ea1058dd130f21311e96dd98dd2","reason":"Claim Garden lifecycle applies as PROTOCOL. Its participants exchange ordered requests/responses across a process or remote boundary with explicit compatibility and failure states. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"PROTOCOL-0.3-failures-and-progress":{"declaration":{"failure_assumptions":"Pre-transport refusal is REJECTED; once a request may have reached the endpoint, an unavailable or inconsistent response remains INDETERMINATE or UNKNOWN and later phases are not assumed.","liveness":"Each request has a finite timeout; no eventual remote progress, review completion, or publication deadline is promised.","recovery":"Inspect the separately authenticated remote state before any manual retry; the client never treats a missing response as an abort or replays it automatically.","safety":"HTTPS origin, JSON shape, byte counts, object counts, identifiers, digests, content types, and response states are bounded and fail closed."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:2eeae4eff8ed693b3c87cb63f1a0bc37ca5e7ea1058dd130f21311e96dd98dd2","reason":"Claim Garden lifecycle applies as PROTOCOL. Its participants exchange ordered requests/responses across a process or remote boundary with explicit compatibility and failure states. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"ROBOT-0.1-agent-to-actuator-binding":{"declaration":{"actuators":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","agent":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","controllers":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","harness":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:2eeae4eff8ed693b3c87cb63f1a0bc37ca5e7ea1058dd130f21311e96dd98dd2","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-robot-vstd-claim-garden-lifecycle-c22cd2a1b2cd; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"ROBOT-0.2-physical-reach-and-observation":{"declaration":{"confinement_evidence":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","domain_crossings":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","observations":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","physical_reach":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:2eeae4eff8ed693b3c87cb63f1a0bc37ca5e7ea1058dd130f21311e96dd98dd2","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-robot-vstd-claim-garden-lifecycle-c22cd2a1b2cd; fulfillm