endent expected digest, and an absent output path are required.","resources":"Targets are one absent local package file and the in-memory retained registry, artifact, implementation, and dependency records."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:cd18f125b7e1597c9eae39bdd7eaa7d4830c1340e19403fd163c76635220742c","reason":"The component-package storage envelope applies as TRANSACTION. Its named local change, response-dependent finality, retry behavior, and partial-failure state require an explicit transaction boundary. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"TRANSACTION-0.2-commit-and-failure":{"declaration":{"abort":"Malformed schemas, missing or duplicate bindings, path collisions, digest mismatch, special/link files, excessive bounds, or an existing/unwritable destination refuses.","commit":"Save commits when the exclusive file write succeeds; it never overwrites, but it is not fsync-backed or coordinated with another application state change.","finality":"Save commits when the exclusive file write succeeds; it never overwrites, but it is not fsync-backed or coordinated with another application state change. Finality is limited to the named local state and grants no application-wide correctness, publication, physical, or financial authority.","partial_failure":"Malformed schemas, missing or duplicate bindings, path collisions, digest mismatch, special/link files, excessive bounds, or an existing/unwritable destination refuses."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:cd18f125b7e1597c9eae39bdd7eaa7d4830c1340e19403fd163c76635220742c","reason":"The component-package storage envelope applies as TRANSACTION. Its named local change, response-dependent finality, retry behavior, and partial-failure state require an explicit transaction boundary. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"TRANSACTION-0.3-retry-and-replay":{"declaration":{"duplicate_detection":"An existing destination refuses duplicate saving; a retry requires a deliberately selected absent path, while loading may be repeated from current bytes.","idempotency":"An existing destination refuses duplicate saving; a retry requires a deliberately selected absent path, while loading may be repeated from current bytes. These are the exact retry semantics; no broader idempotency is inferred.","replay":"Correct the complete package or select an absent destination and retry; an existing stored package is never silently replaced or repaired.","retry_limits":"Package, content, item, path, schema, canonical JSON, ordinary-file, duplicate-key, digest, and exact-reference bounds constrain acceptance."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:cd18f125b7e1597c9eae39bdd7eaa7d4830c1340e19403fd163c76635220742c","reason":"The component-package storage envelope applies as TRANSACTION. Its named local change, response-dependent finality, retry behavior, and partial-failure state require an explicit transaction boundary. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."}},"operands":{},"payload":{"representation_role":"Exclusive-create local component-package persistence and the admitted package record schemas."},"reason":"Publishing selected package bytes changes local storage and therefore needs explicit authorization, duplicate, partial-write and retry treatment. Boundary: Local persistence proves neither publisher or license authority nor package execution, crash durability, external witnessing, custody, physical effect or financial effect.","specializations":["TRANSACTION"],"surfaces":["file:src/verifier/interoperability/storage.py","python:src/verifier/interoperability/storage.py:<module>","python:src/verifier/interoperability/storage.py:ComponentPackageError","python:src/verifier/interoperability/storage.py:_text","python:src/verifier/interoperability/storage