rejected; consent is never inferred from silence.","precedence":"Exact binding and scope checks precede delegation; explicit revocation, expiry, status uncertainty, and malformed or conflicting statements prevent an allow decision.","scope":"Consent evaluation is limited to the exact principal, delegate chain, context, operation, data scope, purpose, constraints, and invocation selected by the trusted caller."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:acb45b8309468a589d0866c11c2d015ed486ef7238045b2b762806cb5b96e90f","reason":"The engine and public-key variant implement exact consent scope, delegation, revocation, status, precedence, authority-selection, and fail-closed decision rules. This source-bound Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"POLICY-0.2-authority-and-exceptions":{"declaration":{"activation":"A policy is active only within its declared time/status and exact binding under the caller-supplied evaluation coordinate; no ambient global activation exists.","authority":"The trusted caller selects principals, keys, policy, time, and status roots; cryptographic validity binds statements but does not prove voluntary human consent or legal authority.","exceptions":"Only explicitly signed and scope-narrowing delegation or constraints are considered; wildcard authority and implicit expansion are not inferred.","revisions":"Changed policy terms, keys, grants, revocations, status roots, contexts, or scopes are distinct captured inputs and must be reevaluated."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:acb45b8309468a589d0866c11c2d015ed486ef7238045b2b762806cb5b96e90f","reason":"The engine and public-key variant implement exact consent scope, delegation, revocation, status, precedence, authority-selection, and fail-closed decision rules. This source-bound Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"POLICY-0.3-enforcement-and-decisions":{"declaration":{"bypass_handling":"Malformed, untrusted, scope-expanding, expired, revoked, or status-uncertain paths do not yield ALLOW; direct noncooperating execution remains outside this module.","decision_evidence":"The evaluation records exact captured inputs, verified statement relationships, checks, verdict, and reasons for the selected invocation.","enforcement_points":"The shared-key and public-key evaluators return bounded verdicts before a cooperating caller acts; they do not intercept or control outside execution.","unavailable_behavior":"Absent keys, status, time, policy, or complete chain fails closed to UNKNOWN or rejection rather than fabricating consent."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:acb45b8309468a589d0866c11c2d015ed486ef7238045b2b762806cb5b96e90f","reason":"The engine and public-key variant implement exact consent scope, delegation, revocation, status, precedence, authority-selection, and fail-closed decision rules. This source-bound Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"PROTOCOL-0.1-participants-and-states":{"declaration":{"participants":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","roles":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","states":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","transitions":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:1bdd92e4f94559243acb161836bf05f11592bca57071e3d5724a0fdec99e43ce","reason":"reasons.vstd:consent-policy-protocol-applies; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"PROTOCOL-0.2-ordering-and-replay":{"declaration":{"compatibility":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","message_authority":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","ordering":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","replay":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:1bdd92e4f94559243acb161836bf05f11592bca57071e3d5724a0fdec99e43ce","reason":"reasons.vstd:consent-policy-protocol-applies; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"PROTOCOL-0.3-failures-and-progress":{"declaration":{"failure_assumptions":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","liveness":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","recovery":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","safety":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:1bdd92e4f94559243