ailable stop/clock behavior remains UNKNOWN; active callbacks may continue.","stability_assumptions":"controlled emission session controls a bounded software lifecycle, not a proved dynamical plant; safe downstream stability remains outside this Tier-0 claim.","timing":"Stop waiting uses a bounded monotonic deadline; an active callback is cooperative and cannot be preempted by this session."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:296ca934bc90124b9538a6038c527a29c8471be8d82b128a34e94ba0c9d18616","reason":"controlled emission session applies as CONTROLLER. Its state, feedback, admission decisions, commands, timing, and intervention behavior form a bounded software control loop. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"CONTROLLER-0.3-intervention-and-failure":{"declaration":{"arbitration":"Stop/capacity/replay checks and reservation are atomic under the lock; the callback runs outside the lock; completion decrements the active count.","failure_behavior":"A stop latch is permanent for the session. Restart or downstream effect reconciliation requires a separately authorized mechanism.","feedback_loss":"Stopped, duplicate, or over-capacity admission fails closed; unavailable stop/clock behavior remains UNKNOWN; active callbacks may continue.","intervention":"Latch STOP or submit one already-authorized callback invocation."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:296ca934bc90124b9538a6038c527a29c8471be8d82b128a34e94ba0c9d18616","reason":"controlled emission session applies as CONTROLLER. Its state, feedback, admission decisions, commands, timing, and intervention behavior form a bounded software control loop. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"FINBOT-0.1-agent-and-financial-authority":{"declaration":{"agent":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","decision_scope":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","financial_authority":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","harnes