ystem endpoints are not represented here."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:296ca934bc90124b9538a6038c527a29c8471be8d82b128a34e94ba0c9d18616","reason":"controlled emission session applies as TRANSACTION. Its named changes, response-dependent finality, duplicate handling, and partial-failure state require an explicit transaction boundary. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"TRANSACTION-0.2-commit-and-failure":{"declaration":{"abort":"Stopped, duplicate, or over-capacity admission fails closed; unavailable stop/clock behavior remains UNKNOWN; active callbacks may continue.","commit":"Commit means that this session called the callback and observed its return value.","finality":"Commit means that this session called the callback and observed its return value. This finality is limited to the named local or remote state; it grants no broader correctness or publication authority.","partial_failure":"Stopped, duplicate, or over-capacity admission fails closed; unavailable stop/clock behavior remains UNKNOWN; active callbacks may continue."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:296ca934bc90124b9538a6038c527a29c8471be8d82b128a34e94ba0c9d18616","reason":"controlled emission session applies as TRANSACTION. Its named changes, response-dependent finality, duplicate handling, and partial-failure state require an explicit transaction boundary. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"TRANSACTION-0.3-retry-and-replay":{"declaration":{"duplicate_detection":"A spent invocation identifier is refused; callback exception or interruption does not make an automatic retry safe.","idempotency":"controlled emission session treats only the explicitly named digest, request, or invocation identity as duplicate evidence; no unstated idempotency is assumed.","replay":"A stop latch is permanent for the session. Restart or downstream effect reconciliation requires a separately authorized mechanism.","retry_limits":"A spent invocation identifier is refused; callback exception or interruption does not make an automatic retry safe."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:296ca934bc90124b9538a6038c527a29c8471be8d82b128a34e94ba0c9d18616","reason":"controlled emission session applies as TRANSACTION. Its named changes, response-dependent finality, duplicate handling, and partial-failure state require an explicit transaction boundary. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."}},"operands":{},"payload":{"representation_role":"Cooperative stop-latched admission controller around consequential local callbacks."},"reason":"Callback admission, concurrent stop, duplicate invocation and completion states require explicit control and transaction boundaries. Boundary: Callback submission is not proof of downstream effect. Only cooperating in-process calls are controlled; actual physical or financial endpoints accumulate ROBOT or FINBOT and their other applicable roles.","specializations":["POLICY","TRANSACTION"],"surfaces":["file:src/verifier/corrigibility/controlled_operation.py","python:src/verifier/corrigibility/controlled_operation.py:<module>","python:src/verifier/corrigibility/controlled_operation.py:StopObservation","python:src/verifier/corrigibility/controlled_operation.py:ControlledInvocation","python:src/verifier/corrigibility/controlled_operation.py:ControlledEmissionSession","python:src/verifier/corrigibility/controlled_operation.py:ControlledEmissionSession.__init__","python:src/verifier/corrigibility/controlled_operation.py:ControlledEmissionSession.session_id","python:src/verifier/corrigibility/controlled_operation.py:ControlledEmissionSession.process_id","python:src/verifier/corrigibility/controlled_operation.py:ControlledEmissionSession.stop_requested","python:src/verifier/corrigibility/controlled_operation.py