tion, physical calibration, confinement or proof that a represented command ran.","phenomenon":"Commit, branch, dirty and untracked paths, redacted remote, Python/platform identity, masked hostname, UTC timestamp and selected SHA-256 file hashes.","source":"Caller-selected repository root, target and portable identifiers, declared command text and a finite sequence of selected key-file paths."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:aea6a0b4a99a79d39b08da115ea05552791a6a03bf9639db3f217370317794a2","reason":"core provenance acquisition applies as MEASUREMENT. Its retained parent-boundary values distinguish what was observed from child or external state that was not observed. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"MEASUREMENT-0.2-units-time-and-uncertainty":{"declaration":{"arrival_time":"core provenance acquisition records parent receipt/completion ordering; it does not reconstruct an unobserved child or external event time.","observation_time":"captured_at_utc is sampled during record construction, not at every Git or file observation; Git calls have no explicit timeout in this mechanism.","reference_frame":"The selected local repository, selected key files, current Python process and operating-system-visible runtime and host metadata.","uncertainty":"This is host-visible software acquisition, not hostile-host attestation, physical calibration, confinement or proof that a represented command ran.","units":"Exact UTF-8 Git text, Boolean dirtiness, discrete paths, byte-oriented SHA-256 identities and an ISO-8601 UTC timestamp."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:aea6a0b4a99a79d39b08da115ea05552791a6a03bf9639db3f217370317794a2","reason":"core provenance acquisition applies as MEASUREMENT. Its retained parent-boundary values distinguish what was observed from child or external state that was not observed. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"MEASUREMENT-0.3-validity-and-missingness":{"declaration":{"freshness":"captured_at_utc is sampled during record construction, not at every Git or file observation; Git calls have no explicit timeout in this mechanism.","missingness":"Missing/non-Git roots and Git errors become explicit sentinel values; missing key files are omitted. Exceptions are not evidence of a clean tree or complete observation.","provenance":"Read selected files and Python platform APIs, sample the UTC clock, and run fixed Git rev-parse, config and status commands with captured text responses.","validity":"Fixed Git argument vectors and caller-selected finite key files bound intent, but repository size, Git response size and command duration are not explicitly bounded."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:aea6a0b4a99a79d39b08da115ea05552791a6a03bf9639db3f217370317794a2","reason":"core provenance acquisition applies as MEASUREMENT. Its retained parent-boundary values distinguish what was observed from child or external state that was not observed. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"POLICY-0.1-rules-and-precedence":{"declaration":{"decision_inputs":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","defaults":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","precedence":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","scope":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:aea6a0b4a99a79d39b08da115ea05552791a6a03bf9639db3f217370317794a2","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-policy-vstd-core-provenance-sensor-ce149eef2e6e; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"POLICY-0.2-authority-and-exceptions":{"declaration":{"activation":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","authority":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","exceptions":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","revisions":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:aea6a0b4a99a79d39b08da115ea05552791a6a03bf9639db3f217370317794a2","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-policy-vstd-core-provenance-sensor-ce149eef2e6e; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"POLICY-0.3-enforcement-and-decisions