 membership are checked before fixed coordinate, remote and status queries; runtime/time and selected-file hashes are then assembled into one returned record.","replay":"Every call reacquires current state. A prior record is historical data and cannot be replayed as a current capture."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:aea6a0b4a99a79d39b08da115ea05552791a6a03bf9639db3f217370317794a2","reason":"core provenance acquisition applies as PROTOCOL. Its participants exchange ordered requests/responses across a process or remote boundary with explicit compatibility and failure states. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"PROTOCOL-0.3-failures-and-progress":{"declaration":{"failure_assumptions":"Missing/non-Git roots and Git errors become explicit sentinel values; missing key files are omitted. Exceptions are not evidence of a clean tree or complete observation.","liveness":"captured_at_utc is sampled during record construction, not at every Git or file observation; Git calls have no explicit timeout in this mechanism.","recovery":"Correct repository/tool/file availability and perform a new capture; do not promote sentinel, omitted or stale fields to current observations.","safety":"Fixed Git argument vectors and caller-selected finite key files bound intent, but repository size, Git response size and command duration are not explicitly bounded."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:aea6a0b4a99a79d39b08da115ea05552791a6a03bf9639db3f217370317794a2","reason":"core provenance acquisition applies as PROTOCOL. Its participants exchange ordered requests/responses across a process or remote boundary with explicit compatibility and failure states. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"ROBOT-0.1-agent-to-actuator-binding":{"declaration":{"actuators":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","agent":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","controllers":"NO