n-1b4acbe3ef14; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"SENSOR-0.2-calibration-and-envelope":{"declaration":{"calibration_applicability":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","calibration_evidence":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","drift":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","operating_range":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:27c21714d58b63754abb92ead6a77efbe75657a99a569e0631c05b99ceec8c7b","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-sensor-vstd-core-receipt-transaction-1b4acbe3ef14; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"SENSOR-0.3-sampling-and-faults":{"declaration":{"fault_detection":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","latency":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","recovery":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","sampling":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:27c21714d58b63754abb92ead6a77efbe75657a99a569e0631c05b99ceec8c7b","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-sensor-vstd-core-receipt-transaction-1b4acbe3ef14; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"TRANSACTION-0.1-effects-and-authority":{"declaration":{"authorization":"The direct caller plus local filesystem permissions authorize writes to the selected path; receipt content grants no publication or external authority.","effects":"Create or replace several local files and directories containing the receipt projection and human-readable report.","preconditions":"One validated receipt object, its claim/evidence/audit/provenance metadata, optional execution metadata and caller-selected output path.","resources":"The caller-selected local output directory and its fixed child paths."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:27c21714d58b63754abb92ead6a77efbe75657a99a569e0631c05b99ceec8c7b","reason":"core receipt publication applies as TRANSACTION. Its named changes, response-dependent finality, duplicate handling, and partial-failure state require an explicit transaction boundary. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"TRANSACTION-0.2-commit-and-failure":{"declaration":{"abort":"Any filesystem or serialization exception stops later writes while earlier files and directories can remain; no automatic rollback or compensation occurs.","commit":"Each write commits separately when pathlib returns; the method returns only after the final report write, but there is no atomic group commit or fsync.","finality":"Each write commits separately when pathlib returns; the method returns only after the final report write, but there is no atomic group commit or fsync. This finality is limited to the named local or remote state; it grants no broader correctness or publication authority.","partial_failure":"Any filesystem or serialization exception stops later writes while earlier files and directories can remain; no automatic rollback or compensation occurs."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:27c21714d58b63754abb92ead6a77efbe75657a99a569e0631c05b99ceec8c7b","reason":"core receipt publication applies as TRANSACTION. Its named changes, response-dependent finality, duplicate handling, and partial-failure state require an explicit transaction boundary. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"TRANSACTION-0.3-retry-and-replay":{"declaration":{"duplicate_detection":"No duplicate guard or exclusive-create rule is present. Retrying can replace earlier files and can mix with files retained by a partial prior attempt.","idempotency":"core receipt publication treats only the explicitly named digest, request, or invocation identity as duplicate evidence; no unstated idempotency is assumed.","replay":"Inspect every selected path and its hashes, preserve unrelated later edits, and explicitly rebuild into a safely selected directory; no retained journal proves rollback.","retry_limits":"No duplicate guard or exclusive-create rule is present. Retrying can replace earlier files and can mix with files retained by a partial prior attempt."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:27c21714d58b63754abb92ead6a77efbe75657a99a569e0631c05b99ceec8c7b","reason":"core receipt publication applies as TRANSACTION. Its named changes, response-dependent finality, duplicate handling, and partial-failure state require an explicit transaction boundary. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."}},"operands":{},"payload":{"representation_role":"Local multi-file receipt and payload publication to a caller-selected directory."},"reason":"Directory creation and sequential exclusive writes have authorization, commit, partial-failure, duplicate and recovery semantics that generic VERIFIER ownership would hide. Boundary: The publication is not atomic across files, crash-durable, externally witnessed or proof that the represented verification occurred; it has no physical or real-money endpoint.","specializations":[],"surfaces":["file:src/verifier/core/receipt.py","python:src/verifier/core/receipt.py:<module>","python:src/verifier/core/receipt.py:StrictJsonError","python:src/verifier/core/receipt.py:_reject_duplicate_object_keys","python:src/verifier/core/receipt.py:_reject_non_finite_constant","python:src/verifier/core/receipt.py:_parse_finite_float","python:src/verifier/core/receipt.py:strict_json_loads","python:src/verifier/core/receipt.py:canonical_json_dumps","python:src/verifier/core/receipt.py:compute_canonical_digest","python:src/verifier/core/receipt.py:ClaimSpec","python:src/verifier/core/receipt.py:ClaimSpec.to_dict","python:src/verifier/core/receipt.py:EvidencePayload","python:src/verifier/core/receipt.py:EvidencePayload.to_dict","python:src/verifier/core/receipt.py:ExecutionMetadata","python:src/verifier/core/receipt.py:ExecutionMetadata.to_dict","python:src/verifier/core/receipt.py:VstdReceipt","python:src/verifier/core/receipt.py:VstdReceipt.__post_init__","python:src/verifier/core/receipt.py:VstdReceipt.get_stable_payload","python:src/verifier/core/receipt.py:VstdReceipt.compute_and_set_digest","python:src/verifier/core/receipt.py:VstdReceipt.verify_digest_integrity","pyt