atus":"DOES_NOT_APPLY"},"MARKET":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:49aef8f204b3ab7c74af450d9336ca6cd1b24ef64d7cecbd5d4849eab96eeb1d","reason":"The demonstration specimen materializer does not apply as MARKET. demo.py builds illustrative specimens and matches no orders, trades, or prices. Reviewed boundary: Demonstration behavior is regression and teaching evidence for fixed specimens, never general proof of package, application, safety, publication, or release correctness.","status":"DOES_NOT_APPLY"},"MEASUREMENT":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:49aef8f204b3ab7c74af450d9336ca6cd1b24ef64d7cecbd5d4849eab96eeb1d","reason":"The demonstration specimen materializer applies as MEASUREMENT. Its report distinguishes exact software-interface observations from unobserved source, mechanism, physical, or external state. Reviewed boundary: Demonstration behavior is regression and teaching evidence for fixed specimens, never general proof of package, application, safety, publication, or release correctness.","status":"APPLIES"},"MODEL":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","reason":"UNRESOLVED.","status":"UNRESOLVED"},"OWNER":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","reason":"UNRESOLVED.","status":"UNRESOLVED"},"POLICY":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:49aef8f204b3ab7c74af450d9336ca6cd1b24ef64d7cecbd5d4849eab96eeb1d","reason":"The demonstration specimen materializer applies as POLICY. Its rule selection, authority boundary, defaults, exceptions, and enforcement points determine the bounded result. Reviewed boundary: Demonstration behavior is regression and teaching evidence for fixed specimens, never general proof of package, application, safety, publication, or release correctness.","status":"APPLIES"},"PROTOCOL":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:49aef8f204b3ab7c74af450d9336ca6cd1b24ef64d7cecbd5d4849eab96eeb1d","reason":"The demonstration specimen materializer does not apply 