alues those sources explicitly admit; undeclared external state is not input.","defaults":"vstd-experiment-catalog-records declaration basis sha256:e3fcc735f6860581c2ecd37f78c645903c476a08a50f61eb668cb556144f512b binds exact source experiments/INDEX.md, experiments/README.md; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-experiment-catalog-records (Repository experiment navigation, declared study state and interpretation boundary.) treats invalid, unavailable, contradictory, partial, or stale inputs as refusal or UNKNOWN rather than silently inferring success.","precedence":"vstd-experiment-catalog-records declaration basis sha256:e3fcc735f6860581c2ecd37f78c645903c476a08a50f61eb668cb556144f512b binds exact source experiments/INDEX.md, experiments/README.md; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-experiment-catalog-records (Repository experiment navigation, declared study state and interpretation boundary.) uses only order explicitly represented by its source-defined calls, records, or dependencies; no global temporal order is inferred.","scope":"vstd-experiment-catalog-records declaration basis sha256:e3fcc735f6860581c2ecd37f78c645903c476a08a50f61eb668cb556144f512b binds exact source experiments/INDEX.md, experiments/README.md; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-experiment-catalog-records (Repository experiment navigation, declared study state and interpretation boundary.) is reviewed only as the path-owned source role declared by the audited partition. Its exact source denominator is experiments/INDEX.md, experiments/README.md."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:611c597179539e0bcba80c6cc7ba062e64aaaace69cc91a9aa37630dc75ad2d5","reason":"vstd-experiment-catalog-records (Repository experiment navigation, declared study state and interpretation boundary.) applies as POLICY. Its rule selection, authority, defaults, and enforcement points decide whether a consequential operation may proceed. Audited semantic basis: vstd-experiment-catalog-records owns Repository experiment navigation, declared study state and interpretation boundary. Exact current source-byte denominator: experiments/INDEX.md, experiments/README.md. Fixed operands: none. Necessity: The experiment estate needs an exact catalog owner so generated index membership cannot be mistaken for normative or executable package coverage. Consequence boundary: Catalog presence proves no hypothesis, reproduction, publication, current execution or VSTD verdict. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed exact-source boundary only; mechanism execution, semantic truth, and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"POLICY-0.2-authority-and-exceptions":{"declaration":{"activation":"vstd-experiment-catalog-records declaration basis sha256:e3fcc735f6860581c2ecd37f78c645903c476a08a50f61eb668cb556144f512b binds exact source experiments/INDEX.md, experiments/README.md; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-experiment-catalog-records (Repository experiment navigation, declared study state and interpretation boundary.) includes only states explicitly represented by the owned sources; unobserved runtime or external states remain UNKNOWN.","authority":"vstd-experiment-catalog-records declaration basis sha256:e3fcc735f6860581c2ecd37f78c645903c476a08a50f61eb668cb556144f512b binds exact source experiments/INDEX.md, experiments/README.md; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-experiment-catalog-records (Repository experiment navigation, declared study state and interpretation boundary.) has only caller invocation and source-declared authority. Ownership review grants no human, legal, physical, financial, or release authority.","exceptions":"vstd-experiment-catalog-records declaration basis sha256:e3fcc735f6860581c2ecd37f78c645903c476a08a50f61eb668cb556144f512b binds exact source experiments/INDEX.md, experiments/README.md; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-experiment-catalog-records (Repository experiment navigation, declared study state and interpretation boundary.) is bounded by limits explicit in its exact source and declared role. Missing limits are not invented by this review.","revisions":"vstd-experiment-catalog-records declaration basis sha256:e3fcc735f6860581c2ecd37f78c645903c476a08a50f61eb668cb556144f512b binds exact source experiments/INDEX.md, experiments/README.md; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-experiment-catalog-records (Repository experiment navigation, declared study state and interpretation boundary.) is represented by current bytes at experiments/INDEX.md, experiments/README.md; the review binds those bytes but does not execute or validate them."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:611c597179539e0bcba80c6cc7ba062e64aaaace69cc91a9aa37630dc75ad2d5","reason":"vstd-experiment-catalog-records (Repository experiment navigation, declared study state and interpretation boundary.) applies as POLICY. Its rule selection, authority, defaults, and enforcement points decide whether a consequential operation may proceed. Audited semantic basis: vstd-experiment-catalog-records owns Repository experiment navigation, declared study state and interpretation boundary. Exact current source-