lone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-experiment-index-materialization (Deterministic validation and rendering of the public experimental-manifest index.) can submit only calls, callbacks, decisions, or records implemented by its owned sources; downstream effects require separate evidence.","effect_domains":"vstd-experiment-index-materialization declaration basis sha256:eb788fa5e8b719c9c1e3c7120fbc3c2206efb4787e03c682d57cca03c17c5ed6 binds exact source scripts/build_experiment_index.py; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-experiment-index-materialization (Deterministic validation and rendering of the public experimental-manifest index.) is bounded to declared software effects. No physical or real-money effect domain is inferred from source ownership.","targets":"vstd-experiment-index-materialization declaration basis sha256:eb788fa5e8b719c9c1e3c7120fbc3c2206efb4787e03c682d57cca03c17c5ed6 binds exact source scripts/build_experiment_index.py; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-experiment-index-materialization (Deterministic validation and rendering of the public experimental-manifest index.) is limited to in-process values and any files, processes, or endpoints explicitly selected by its owned sources."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:37b0873f550b709a61da0f33e8e18f430298528e5d4f4b53809a65b1a107e530","reason":"vstd-experiment-index-materialization (Deterministic validation and rendering of the public experimental-manifest index.) applies as ACTUATOR. Its owned source connects an accepted command to a represented real or simulated effect endpoint and exposes effect feedback plus an explicit failure surface. Submission, dispatch, replay, callback entry, or child-process launch alone is insufficien