ed to the named local or remote state; it grants no broader correctness or publication authority.","partial_failure":"Local refusal sends nothing; after POST is attempted, unavailable or inconsistent response remains UNKNOWN."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:e887eac1d363da0efd4ef04cdbae5b9b9ea90c23bacbf74dab9c16be4587ace7","reason":"gated private-review submission applies as TRANSACTION. Its named changes, response-dependent finality, duplicate handling, and partial-failure state require an explicit transaction boundary. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"TRANSACTION-0.3-retry-and-replay":{"declaration":{"duplicate_detection":"There is no automatic POST retry; response uncertainty remains UNKNOWN and requires remote inspection.","idempotency":"gated private-review submission treats only the explicitly named digest, request, or invocation identity as duplicate evidence; no unstated idempotency is assumed.","replay":"Inspect authenticated remote submission state before any new explicit submission; never infer abort from silence.","retry_limits":"There is no automatic POST retry; response uncertainty remains UNKNOWN and requires remote inspection."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:e887eac1d363da0efd4ef04cdbae5b9b9ea90c23bacbf74dab9c16be4587ace7","reason":"gated private-review submission applies as TRANSACTION. Its named changes, response-dependent finality, duplicate handling, and partial-failure state require an explicit transaction boundary. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."}},"operands":{},"payload":{"representation_role":"Gate-bound preparation, account preflight and one-shot remote submission for private human review."},"reason":"Credentialed submission, quota accounting, deduplication and remote final states require explicit protocol and transaction treatment. Boundary: Preparat