o each reached handler's commit and partial-failure boundary is part of this facade's dispatch. Reviewed boundary: The facade is a software command protocol, not a sandbox, hardware sensor, physical controller, attestation root, durable ledger, or authority to publish or release. This Tier-0 declaration names only the exact reviewed source boundary; execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."}},"operands":{},"payload":{"representation_role":"Stable VSTD 3 parser, key-decoding, dispatch, output-framing and exit-status protocol."},"reason":"Command selection and framing cross a caller/tool boundary; dispatch reaches live acquisition, emitted observation, and local-write handlers, so sensor, measurement, transaction, policy, protocol and bounded software-effect semantics are necessary. Boundary: The facade reaches host queries and bounded local writes but establishes no caller identity, authorization, sandbox, hardware fact beyond the reported observation, physical actuation, financial effect, publication or release authority.","specializations":["ACTUATOR","ASSET","CONTROLLER","FINBOT","LEDGER","MARKET","MEASUREMENT","POLICY","ROBOT","SENSOR","TRANSACTION"],"surfaces":["file:src/verifier/runtime/hardware_cli.py","python:src/verifier/runtime/hardware_cli.py:<module>","python:src/verifier/runtime/hardware_cli.py:add_vstd3_parsers","python:src/verifier/runtime/hardware_cli.py:_handle_hardware_command","python:src/verifier/runtime/hardware_cli.py:handle_vstd3_command","file:src/verifier/runtime/hardware_cli_support.py","python:src/verifier/runtime/hardware_cli_support.py:<module>","python:src/verifier/runtime/hardware_cli_support.py:add_output_flags","python:src/verifier/runtime/hardware_cli_support.py:parse_verification_keys","python:src/verifier/runtime/hardware_cli_support.py:status_exit","python:src/verifier/runtime/hardware_cli_support.py:emit","python:src/verifier/runtime/hardware_cli_support.py:parse_timestamp","python:src/verifier/runtime/hardware