ipt file helper applies as TRANSACTION. Its named local change, response-dependent finality, retry behavior, and partial-failure state require an explicit transaction boundary. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"TRANSACTION-0.2-commit-and-failure":{"declaration":{"abort":"Filesystem errors, non-object JSON, strict-decode failure, or digest mismatch raises VSTD3ReceiptError; a failed truncating write may leave filesystem state unknown.","commit":"The helper reports success after path.write_bytes returns; the write may replace existing bytes and is not atomic, exclusive, fsync-backed, or externally witnessed.","finality":"The helper reports success after path.write_bytes returns; the write may replace existing bytes and is not atomic, exclusive, fsync-backed, or externally witnessed. Finality is limited to the named local state and grants no application-wide correctness, publication, physical, or financial authority.","partial_failure":"Filesystem errors, non-object JSON, strict-decode failure, or digest mismatch raises VSTD3ReceiptError; a failed truncating write may leave filesystem state unknown."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:9e0d5df8456eb10df89a2e386561cca19fdcce9f8ba1c78cf8a880b56d1fd27f","reason":"The VSTD-3 receipt file helper applies as TRANSACTION. Its named local change, response-dependent finality, retry behavior, and partial-failure state require an explicit transaction boundary. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"TRANSACTION-0.3-retry-and-replay":{"declaration":{"duplicate_detection":"A repeated save can overwrite the same path; no duplicate detection, compare-and-swap, idempotency key, or retained correction history is provided.","idempotency":"A repeated save can overwrite the same path; no duplicate detection, compare-and-swap, idempotency key, or retained correction history is provided. These are the exact retry semantics; no broader idempotency is inferred.","replay":"Recovery requires independently inspecting or replacing the local file and retrying; the helper owns no journal, rollback, reconciliation, or correction history.","retry_limits":"Strict VSTD-3 decoding and canonical digest equality bound accepted loads; filesystem size and hostile-input bounds are not added by this helper."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:9e0d5df8456eb10df89a2e386561cca19fdcce9f8ba1c78cf8a880b56d1fd27f","reason":"The VSTD-3 receipt file helper applies as TRANSACTION. Its named local change, response-dependent finality, retry behavior, and partial-failure state require an explicit transaction boundary. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."}},"operands":{"hardware":["vstd-hardware"],"subject":["vstd-hardware"]},"payload":{"representation_role":"Local hardware-receipt serialization and caller-selected file publication."},"reason":"A receipt write has authority, target, replacement, partial-failure and replay questions distinct from the receipt's represented hardware claim. Boundary: The truncating local write is not atomic, exclusive, fsync-durable, externally witnessed, retained history, physical observation, custody proof or financial finality.","specializations":["TRANSACTION"],"surfaces":["file:src/verifier/hardware/receipt.py","python:src/verifier/hardware/receipt.py:<module>","python:src/verifier/hardware/receipt.py:VSTD3ReceiptError","python:src/verifier/hardware/receipt.py:save_vstd3_receipt","python:src/verifier/hardware/receipt.py:load_vstd3_receipt","python:src/verifier/hardware/receipt.py:is_vstd3_receipt"]},{"classification":{"ACTOR":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","reason":"UNRESOLVED.","status":"UNRESOLVED"},"ACTUATOR":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:f5370223b803c0feb19cc14775e