pplied member and device identities plus per-parent, quantity-name, and unit total keys in the returned result.","precision":"Unique identifiers, exact manifest binding, disjoint logical/physical scopes, capacity fractions no greater than one million parts per million, and like-unit keys bound aggregation.","rights":"The supplied manifest is the local comparison authority only; the module authenticates neither its issuer nor physical devices, ownership, custody, or allocation rights.","units":"Capacity is parts per million; resource totals retain each supplied quantity name and unit with Decimal precision and are never converted across units."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:3964531c0708b5d8dfd5a2df77e0d7517971390629ce0154889b82bb1047971e","reason":"The supplied hardware fleet and partition accountant applies as ASSET. Its supplied capacity identities and quantities need explicit units, allocation, backing, and reconciliation boundaries; this is a computational resource claim, not legal title or live custody. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"ASSET-0.2-issuance-and-redemption":{"declaration":{"backing_claims":"This is pure supplied-record accounting. It is not a live SENSOR, does not calibrate or authenticate hardware, and does not establish legal title, custody, backing, durable ledger state, or physical allocation.","issuance_authority":"No issuance authority is implemented. The supplied fleet manifest is only the local comparison authority for declared computational capacity.","redemption":"No redemption operation exists; correcting supplied records and rerunning does not restore or transfer a real resource right.","supply_changes":"This pure function neither issues nor destroys capacity; a different supplied manifest or identity set is a new input, not a supply event."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:3964531c0708b5d8dfd5a2df77e0d7517971390629ce0154889b82bb1047971e","re