 no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-interoperability-composition-harness (Bounded proof-producer/checker and retained interoperability composition exercises.) is bounded to declared software effects. No physical or real-money effect domain is inferred from source ownership.","targets":"vstd-interoperability-composition-harness declaration basis sha256:e6695b10618f40462dd115c1b6934caf15dca1dde16ea8da3ff01e1eb6680870 binds exact source examples/interoperability_compositions/README.md, examples/interoperability_compositions/refutation_chain.py; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-interoperability-composition-harness (Bounded proof-producer/checker and retained interoperability composition exercises.) is limited to in-process values and any files, processes, or endpoints explicitly selected by its owned sources."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:d11b03fa821d4f8615a188617b7a00c225003453dcf435a6765913f2fa40708e","reason":"vstd-interoperability-composition-harness (Bounded proof-producer/checker and retained interoperability composition exercises.) applies as ACTUATOR. Its owned source connects an accepted command to a represented real or simulated effect endpoint and exposes effect feedback plus an explicit failure surface. Submission, dispatch, replay, callback entry, or child-process launch alone is insufficient. Audited semantic basis: vstd-interoperability-composition-harness owns Bounded proof-producer/checker and retained interoperability composition exercises. Exact current source-byte denominator: examples/interoperability_compositions/README.md, examples/interoperability_compositions/refutation_chain.py. Fixed operands: none. Necessity: The harness selects, invokes, observes, and relates multiple verifier-like components while retaining native results and artifact identities. Consequence boundary: Composition does not create safet