 census.","states":"Request admitted, parsed with surfaces/gaps, parser unavailable, capacity-exhausted, or protocol-refused.","transitions":"Response rows must correspond one-for-one and in order to the submitted source rows."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:a3345563e1a1f8d8b9971ea720df6940bc8f898092c496a1b8de990dab9dcae7","reason":"JavaScript parser exchange applies as PROTOCOL. Its participants exchange ordered requests/responses across a process or remote boundary with explicit compatibility and failure states. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"PROTOCOL-0.2-ordering-and-replay":{"declaration":{"compatibility":"A fixed Python -I -B worker binds its own digest and pinned tree-sitter distribution bytes before and after parsing.","message_authority":"Only the parent may submit the exact parser request; neither side receives authority to run subject code.","ordering":"Response rows must correspond one-for-one and in order to the submitted source rows.","replay":"A new parse may repeat the same pure request; previous response prose is never authority for changed bytes."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:a3345563e1a1f8d8b9971ea720df6940bc8f898092c496a1b8de990dab9dcae7","reason":"JavaScript parser exchange applies as PROTOCOL. Its participants exchange ordered requests/responses across a process or remote boundary with explicit compatibility and failure states. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"PROTOCOL-0.3-failures-and-progress":{"declaration":{"failure_assumptions":"Parser absence, syntax gaps, dynamic exports, timeout, or response mismatch remains an explicit gap/refusal.","liveness":"The parent enforces a finite worker timeout; parser completion beyond it is unavailable.","recovery":"Install the pinned optional parser or provide corrected exact source and rerun; never execute sub