al-preflight-controller (Local pre-push gate orchestration, child-process control, result observation, and optional hook installation.) has only caller invocation and source-declared authority. Ownership review grants no human, legal, physical, financial, or release authority.","commands":"vstd-local-preflight-controller declaration basis sha256:2abc3280b0ce3503a54d1b639bb414941ad08fc69c304c2e316ac871c19317b0 binds exact source scripts/preflight.py; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-local-preflight-controller (Local pre-push gate orchestration, child-process control, result observation, and optional hook installation.) can submit only calls, callbacks, decisions, or records implemented by its owned sources; downstream effects require separate evidence.","effect_domains":"vstd-local-preflight-controller declaration basis sha256:2abc3280b0ce3503a54d1b639bb414941ad08fc69c304c2e316ac871c19317b0 binds exact source scripts/preflight.py; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-local-preflight-controller (Local pre-push gate orchestration, child-process control, result observation, and optional hook installation.) is bounded to declared software effects. No physical or real-money effect domain is inferred from source ownership.","targets":"vstd-local-preflight-controller declaration basis sha256:2abc3280b0ce3503a54d1b639bb414941ad08fc69c304c2e316ac871c19317b0 binds exact source scripts/preflight.py; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-local-preflight-controller (Local pre-push gate orchestration, child-process control, result observation, and optional hook installation.) is limited to in-process values and any files, processes, or endpoints explicitly selected by its owned sources."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:91b94c22119921585529b7e184b536a7e3dd0fc30cba6549d850d6a266342c70","reason":"vstd-local-preflight-controller (Local pre-push gate orchestration, child-process control, result observation, and optional hook installation.) applies as ACTUATOR. Its owned source connects an accepted command to a represented real or simulated effect endpoint and exposes effect feedback plus an explicit failure surface. Submission, dispatch, replay, callback entry, or child-process launch alone is insufficient. Audited semantic basis: vstd-local-preflight-controller owns Local pre-push gate orchestration, child-process control, result observation, and optional hook installation. Exact current source-byte denominator: scripts/preflight.py. Fixed operands: none. Necessity: Preflight selects and launches repository checks, observes their bounded outcomes, and may change a local hook, requiring explicit control and effect semantics. Consequence boundary: Local success does not push, merge, publish, reproduce hosted CI, prove a clean tree, or grant release authority; hook installation is a local convenience only. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed exact-source boundary only; mechanism execution, semantic truth, and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"ACTUATOR-0.2-response-and-limits":{"declaration":{"limits":"vstd-local-preflight-controller declaration basis sha256:2abc3280b0ce3503a54d1b639bb414941ad08fc69c304c2e316ac871c19317b0 binds exact source scripts/preflight.py; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-local-preflight-controller (Local pre-push gate orchestration, child-process control, result observation, and optional hook installation.) is bounded by limits explicit in its exact source and declared role. Missing limits are not invented by this review.","response":"vstd-local-preflight-controller declaration basis sha256:2abc3280b0ce3503a54d1b639bb414941ad08fc69c304c2e316ac871c19317b0 binds exact source scripts/preflight.py; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-local-preflight-controller (Local pre-push gate orchestration, child-process control, result observation, and optional hook installation.) exposes only source-defined return values, records, or diagnostics; they are not promoted to semantic or external-world truth.","saturation":"vstd-local-preflight-controller declaration basis sha256:2abc3280b0ce3503a54d1b639bb414941ad08fc69c304c2e316ac871c19317b0 binds exact source scripts/preflight.py; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-local-preflight-controller (Local pre-push gate orchestration, child-process control, result observation, and optional hook installation.) treats invalid, unavailable, contradictory, partial, or stale inputs as refusal or UNKNOWN rather than silently inferring success.","units_and_frames":"vstd-local-preflight-controller declaration basis sha256:2abc3280b0ce3503a54d1b639bb414941ad08fc69c304c2e316ac871c19317b0 binds exact source scripts/preflight.py; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-local-preflight-controller (Local pre-push gate orchestration, child-process control, result observation, and optional hook installation.) retains the bytes, counts, identifiers, times, quantities, and units explicitly named by its source; no unit conversion is inferred."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:91b94c22119921585529b7e184b536a7e3dd0fc30cba6549d850d6a266342c70","reason":"vstd-local-preflight-controller