. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."}},"operands":{},"payload":{"representation_role":"Revocable permission lifecycle and bounded append-only event trace admitting one registered invocation and one separately admitted successor."},"reason":"Grant verification, registration, cancellation, drain and callback-entry races require one explicit control lifecycle and authoritative local event sequence. Boundary: Callback admission and submission are not proof of downstream effect. The trace is local in-memory history with an optional exact external anchor, not effect replay, durable global history or financial accounting; actual physical or financial endpoints accumulate ROBOT or FINBOT and their other applicable roles.","specializations":["LEDGER","POLICY","PROTOCOL","TRANSACTION"],"surfaces":["file:src/verifier/runtime/permission_slot.py","python:src/verifier/runtime/permission_slot.py:<module>","python:src/verifier/runtime/permission_slot.py:Outcome","python:src/verifier/runtime/permission_slot.py:_identifier","python:src/verifier/runtime/permission_slot.py:_digest","python:src/verifier/runtime/permission_slot.py:_bound","python:src/verifier/runtime/permission_slot.py:_counter","python:src/verifier/runtime/permission_slot.py:_outcome","python:src/verifier/runtime/permission_slot.py:Selection","python:src/verifier/runtime/permission_slot.py:Selection.__post_init__","python:src/verifier/runtime/permission_slot.py:Grant","python:src/verifier/runtime/permission_slot.py:Grant.__post_init__","python:src/verifier/runtime/permission_slot.py:Ticket","python:src/verifier/runtime/permission_slot.py:Ticket.__post_init__","python:src/verifier/runtime/permission_slot.py:RestartIntent","python:src/verifier/runtime/permission_slot.py:RestartIntent.__post_init__","python:src/verifier/runtime/permission_slot.py:Census","python:src/verifier/runtime/permission_slot.py:Census.__post_init__","python