uation has explicit preconditions, commit, partial-failure, retry, and replay consequences. Exact source-specific basis: Acquire selected files, invoke one bounded command handler and emit its result; downstream handler success and external effects are not inferred from dispatch. Reviewed boundary: Command dispatch is not a sandbox, mechanism proof, atomic preparation, polish promotion, release, deployment, physical control or financial authority. Audited source anchor: polish_cli.py:272-327. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"TRANSACTION-0.2-commit-and-failure":{"declaration":{"abort":"Incompatible options or malformed inputs fail; unavailable selected files remain UNKNOWN, and unknown handler status cannot be promoted by rendering.","commit":"Commit is return of the selected handler exit code after rendering its bounded record, not transactional package polish or atomic preparation.","finality":"Commit is return of the selected handler exit code after rendering its bounded record, not transactional package polish or atomic preparation. This finality is limited to the named local or remote state; it grants no broader correctness or publication authority.","partial_failure":"Incompatible options or malformed inputs fail; unavailable selected files remain UNKNOWN, and unknown handler status cannot be promoted by rendering."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:3f428a4e42707e18a0871048ee74922d43b1bfe5efbb5d740045996351144c29","reason":"polish command controller applies as TRANSACTION. Its bounded construction or evaluation has explicit preconditions, commit, partial-failure, retry, and replay consequences. Exact source-specific basis: Acquire selected files, invoke one bounded command handler and emit its result; downstream handler success and external effects are not inferred from dispatch. Reviewed boundary: Command dispatch is not a sandbox, mechanism proof, atomic preparation