t, consent, and governance inputs."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:43fc9f83000028f1b6824c3c51f818c0a2cb7b1d924ae22e603f6ddd04c6b8cf","reason":"The bounded privacy-emission evaluator applies as POLICY. Its rule selection, authority, defaults, exceptions, and enforcement points decide whether the bounded consequential operation may proceed. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"POLICY-0.2-authority-and-exceptions":{"declaration":{"activation":"States include uncaptured, captured, admitted, refused, budget available/exhausted, receipt emitted, and replay matched or rejected.","authority":"Only caller-supplied policy, consent, observer, governance, and in-memory budget configuration authorizes a local decision; the receipt is not its own authority.","exceptions":"Finite JSON shape/bytes, exact bound coverage, allowed observers, composition screens, nonnegative finite epsilon/delta, and configured maxima bound admission.","revisions":"The evaluator snapshots finite plain inputs, applies field bounds and composition screens, consumes an in-memory budget when requested, and emits digest-bound local decisions and receipts. Current shipped source and explicit configuration define this revision; no implicit or remote revision authority is inferred."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:43fc9f83000028f1b6824c3c51f818c0a2cb7b1d924ae22e603f6ddd04c6b8cf","reason":"The bounded privacy-emission evaluator applies as POLICY. Its rule selection, authority, defaults, exceptions, and enforcement points decide whether the bounded consequential operation may proceed. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"POLICY-0.3-enforcement-and-decisions":{"declaration":{"bypass_handling":"Finite JSON shape/bytes, exact bound coverage, allowed observers, composition screens, nonnegative finite epsilon/delta, and configured maxima bound admission.","decision_evidence":"The returned decision records selected fields, redactions, bound identifiers, composition-screen outcomes, budget totals, digests, and explicit refusal reasons.","enforcement_points":"The evaluator snapshots finite plain inputs, applies field bounds and composition screens, consumes an in-memory budget when requested, and emits digest-bound local decisions and receipts.","unavailable_behavior":"Missing bounds, observer mismatch, unsafe composition, malformed input, budget exhaustion, concurrent mutation, or replay mismatch fails closed without external emission."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:43fc9f83000028f1b6824c3c51f818c0a2cb7b1d924ae22e603f6ddd04c6b8cf","reason":"The bounded privacy-emission evaluator applies as POLICY. Its rule selection, authority, defaults, exceptions, and enforcement points decide whether the bounded consequential operation may proceed. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"PROTOCOL-0.1-participants-and-states":{"declaration":{"participants":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","roles":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","states":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","transitions":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:713c5e1f94fee50f4342b6e1d0645623bfefe8dc2bf8ddd663f1b63486c1d8a6","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-protocol-vstd-privacy-emission-policy-3bc063aad592; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"PROTOCOL-0.2-ordering-and-replay":{"declaration":{"compatibility":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","message_authority":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","ordering":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","replay":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:713c5e1f94fee50f4342b6e1d0645623bfefe8dc2bf8ddd663f1b63486c1d8a6","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-protocol-vstd-privacy-emission-policy-3bc063aad592; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"PROTOCOL-0.3-failures-and-progress":{"declaration":{"failure_assumptions":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","liveness":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","recovery":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","safety":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"e