-retention-policy-4f4e296d7ea2; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"LEDGER-0.2-accounting-invariants":{"declaration":{"balance_rules":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","rounding":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","sources_and_sinks":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","units":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:56aed094bf573170b8809b529a5becdad9dfce6f9832397389c7ba3631fbbbb3","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-ledger-vstd-retention-policy-4f4e296d7ea2; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"LEDGER-0.3-correction-and-recovery":{"declaration":{"corrections":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","reconciliation":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","recovery":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","replay":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:56aed094bf573170b8809b529a5becdad9dfce6f9832397389c7ba3631fbbbb3","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-ledger-vstd-retention-policy-4f4e296d7ea2; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"MARKET-0.1-orders-and-access":{"declaration":{"cancellation":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","order_states":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","participant_access":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","validation":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:56aed094bf573170b8809b529a5becdad9dfce6f9832397389c7ba3631fbbbb3","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-market-vstd-retention-policy-43353942b0c1; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"MARKET-0.2-matching-and-allocation":{"declaration":{"allocation":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","manipulation_controls":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","matching":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","price_formation":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:56aed094bf573170b8809b529a5becdad9dfce6f9832397389c7ba3631fbbbb3","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-market-vstd-retention-policy-43353942b0c1; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"MARKET-0.3-settlement-and-disruption":{"declaration":{"disruption":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","finality":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","participant_failure":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","settlement_dependencies":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:56aed094bf573170b8809b529a5becdad9dfce6f9832397389c7ba3631fbbbb3","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-market-vstd-retention-policy-43353942b0c1; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"MEASUREMENT-0.1-phenomenon-and-method":{"declaration":{"method":"ArtifactAvailability.assess deterministically compares the supplied observation, content digest, locator, policy validity, and declared level, then assess_bundle takes the weakest critical result.","observation_vs_estimate":"Byte equality is evaluated from a retained observation; future retrievability and retention duration are declarations, not measured guarantees or estimates promoted to fact.","phenomenon":"The assessed phenomenon is whether exact artifact bytes supplied as a RetrievalObservation match a declared content address and locator under a declared retention commitment.","source":"Sources are caller-supplied artifact declarations, RetentionPolicy terms, and RetrievalObservation bytes, time, observer, locator, and artifact id; this module fetches nothing itself."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:56aed094bf573170b8809b529a5becdad9dfce6f9832397389c7ba3631fbbbb3","reason":"The source evaluates exact supplied retrieval bytes, content identity, locator, observation coordinates, missingness, and derived availability levels; it does not acquire them. This source-bound Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"MEASUREMENT-0.2-units-time-and-uncertainty":{"declaration":{"arrival_time":"No acquisition occurs here; the supplied RetrievalObservation is already present at evaluation, so network arrival latency remains unobserved.","observation_time":"observed_at is caller-supplied nonempty text and is retained, not authenticated or sampled by this module.","reference_frame":"Each result is relative to one artifact_id, declared locator, content address, policy declarant, and caller-supplied observation coordinate.","uncertainty":"Content equality is exact for supplied bytes, but observer identity, clock truth, locator reachability outside the observation, and future retention reliability remain unestablished.","units":"Artifact bytes are counted and hashed exactly; policy duration/end coordinates are retained ISO-8601 text, and availability is an ordered categorical level."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:56aed094bf573170b8809b529a5becdad9dfce6f9832397389c7ba3631fbbbb3","reason":"The source evaluates exact supplied retrieval bytes, content identity, locator, observation coordinates, missingness, and derived availability levels; it does not acquire them. This source-bound Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"MEASUREMENT-0.3-validity-and-missingness":{"declaration":{"freshness":"Freshness is limited to the caller-supplied observation coordinate; the source makes no live re-fetch or continuing-availability assertion.","missingness":"An absent or mismatching observation cannot establish current retrievability; missing critical artifacts lower the bundle outcome rather than being filled with success.","provenance":"The assessment binds artifact declaration, policy, supplied observer and time, locator, retrieved-byte digest, and derived reason without authenticating the observer.","validity":"Validity requires exact artifact id, locator, content-address match, nonempty observation metadata, valid policy terms, and consistent declared-versus-derived level."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:56aed094bf573170b8809b529a5becdad9dfce6f9832397389c7ba3631fbbbb3","reason":"The source evaluates exact supplied retrieval bytes, content identity, locator, observation coordinates, missingness, and derived availability levels; it does not acquire them. This source-bound Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"POLICY-0.1-rules-and-precedence":{"declaration":{"decision_inputs":"Inputs are ArtifactAvailability declarations, valid RetentionPolicy terms, optional exact RetrievalObservation records, and bundle criticality/required level.","defaults":"Missing observations establish at most weaker identified/declared states; invalid policy or overstated level is not treated as available.","precedence":"Exact observed-byte mismatch or an overstated declaration fails; bundle assessment uses the weakest critical artifact and does not let stronger noncritical artifacts mask it.","scope":"Policy records the declared retention horizon, responsible party, locator, content address, criticality, and minimum availability level for selected artifacts; the horizon is checked only as nonblank (layer4/availability.py:88-89) and is not evaluated."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:56aed094bf573170b8809b529a5becdad9dfce6f9832397389c7ba3631fbbbb3","reason":"RetentionPolicy and bundle assessment implement declared responsibility, duration, criticality, minimum-level, overstatement, and fail-closed availability rules. This source-bound Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"POLICY-0.2-authority-and-exceptions":{"declaration":{"activation":"A policy contributes to one explicit assessment when its fields are valid; the module does not activate storage services or schedule retention work.","authority":"The policy records who declares retention, but this module does not verify identity, legal duty, storage control, or future performance.","exceptions":"Only artifacts explicitly marked noncritical are excluded from the critical floor; no missing critical artifact is silently waived.","revisions":"Changed bytes, address, locator, retention terms, declarant, criticality, required level, or observation constitute a new assessment input."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:56aed094bf573170b8809b529a5becdad9dfce6f9832397389c7ba3631fbbbb3","reason":"RetentionPolicy and bundle assessment implement declared responsibility, duration, criticality, minimum-level, overstatement, and fail-closed availability rules. This source-bound Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"POLICY-0.3-enforcement-and-decisions":{"declaration":{"bypass_handling":"A declared high level, nonmatching bytes, invalid policy, missing observation, or omitted critical artifact cannot be converted to successful availability by prose alone.","decision_evidence":"AvailabilityAssessment retains artifact declarations, matching supplied observations, derived levels, required level, overstated ids, and reasons.","enforcement_points":"ArtifactAvailability.assess derives per-artifact level and overstatement; assess_bundle enforces the critical-artifact floor and reports failures.","unavailable_behavior":"Without a valid matching observation and policy, live retrievability or retained availability remains unestablished and the derived level stays bounded accordingly."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:56aed094bf573170b8809b529a5becdad9dfce6f9832397389c7ba3631fbbbb3","reason":"RetentionPolicy and bundle assessment implement declared responsibility, duration, criticality, minimum-level, overstatement, and fail-closed availability rules. This source-bound Tier-0 declaration states the boundary; mechanism truth and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"PROTOCOL-0.1-participants-and-states":{"declaration":{"participants":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","roles":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","states":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","transitions":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:56aed094bf573170b8809b529a5becdad9dfce6f9832397389c7ba3631fbbbb3","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-protocol-vstd-retention-policy-728e68878fc2; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"PROTOCOL-0.2-ordering-and-replay":{"declaration":{"compatibility":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","message_authority":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","ordering":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","replay":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:56aed094bf573170b8809b529a5becdad9dfce6f9832397389c7ba3631fbbbb3","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-protocol-vstd-retention-policy-728e68878fc2; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"PROTOCOL-0.3-failures-and-progress":{"declaration":{"failure_assumptions":