LISHED","provenance":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","validity":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:43099f1799bec462cfa3f1b0ee11ca2323a3178fc8da5db31ead98a43df7d22f","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-measurement-vstd-scitt-evidence-protocol-44f8c29d5d45; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"POLICY-0.1-rules-and-precedence":{"declaration":{"decision_inputs":"Exact receipts, claim coordinates, evidence bounds, subject inputs, accepted issuers, pinned profile/draft values, and normalized native verifier results are required.","defaults":"Malformed or ambiguous mappings, digest/subject/issuer mismatch, unsupported revisions/states, absent native verification, or noncanonical derived inputs fail or remain explicitly unknown.","precedence":"Create and bind the VSTD payload before external SCITT production; consume native evidence before composition; composition never upgrades either input's epistemic strength.","scope":"Deterministic mapping among bounded VSTD receipt coordinates, pinned experimental SCITT templates/evidence vocabularies, derived-subject values, and monotone composed result states."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:6c6d3831f230c7fcf78c9cc6b779eb39c4de5cc73d57e8bdcaac5e67c3fc7542","reason":"The experimental SCITT evidence mapper for VSTD receipts applies as POLICY. Its rule selection, authority, defaults, exceptions, and enforcement points decide whether the bounded consequential operation may proceed. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"POLICY-0.2-authority-and-exceptions":{"declaration":{"activation":"States include template prepared, native verification not evaluated/verified/rejected, SCITT missing/pending/registered/invalid, derived subject match/no-match/not-established, and composed pass/fail/unknown.","authority":"Only explicit relying-party issuer/profile selections and separately supplied native verifier outcomes authorize a local mapping decision; embedded PASS text and templates are never self-authorizing.","exceptions":"Pinned draft revisions/profiles, exact fields, canonical JSON, bounded identifier/input lengths, SHA-256 equality, accepted issuer sets, and monotone state tables bound mapping.","revisions":"Canonical JSON and SHA-256 bind mapping records; pinned draft algorithms derive subjects; strict adapters validate normalized caller-supplied native VSTD and SCITT verifier evidence without implementing signing or transport. Current shipped source and explicit configuration define this revision; no implicit or remote revision authority is inferred."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:6c6d3831f230c7fcf78c9cc6b779eb39c4de5cc73d57e8bdcaac5e67c3fc7542","reason":"The experimental SCITT evidence mapper for VSTD receipts applies as POLICY. Its rule selection, authority, defaults, exceptions, and enforcement points decide whether the bounded consequential operation may proceed. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"POLICY-0.3-enforcement-and-decisions":{"declaration":{"bypass_handling":"Pinned draft revisions/profiles, exact fields, canonical JSON, bounded identifier/input lengths, SHA-256 equality, accepted issuer sets, and monotone state tables bound mapping.","decision_evidence":"The mapper observes only supplied canonical records and normalized native results, retaining issuer, service, profile, digest, subject, status, limitations, and NOT_EVALUATED states.","enforcement_points":"Canonical JSON and SHA-256 bind mapping records; pinned draft algorithms derive subjects; strict adapters validate normalized caller-supplied native VSTD and SCITT verifier evidence without implementing signing or transport.","unavailable_behavior":"Malformed or ambiguous mappings, digest/subject/issuer mismatch, unsupported revisions/states, absent native verification, or noncanonical derived inputs fail or remain explicitly unknown."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:6c6d3831f230c7fcf78c9cc6b779eb39c4de5cc73d57e8bdcaac5e67c3fc7542","reason":"The experimental SCITT evidence mapper for VSTD receipts applies as POLICY. Its rule selection, authority, defaults, exceptions, and enforcement points decide whether the bounded consequential operation may proceed. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"PROTOCOL-0.1-participants-and-states":{"declaration":{"participants":"A caller, VSTD receipt/result records, a registration-template consumer, separately operated native VSTD and SCITT verifiers, relying-party policy inputs, and derived-subject/profile adapters participate.","roles":"Deterministic mapping among bounded VSTD receipt coordinates, pinned experimental SCITT templates/evidence vocabularies, derived-subject values, and monotone composed result states.","states":"States include template prepared, native verification not evaluated/verified/rejected, SCITT missing/pending/registered/invalid, derived subject match/no-match/not-established, and composed pass/fail/unknown.","transitions":"Create and bind the VSTD payload before external SCITT production; consume native evidence before composition; composition never upgrades either input's epistemic strength."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:6c6d3831f230c7fcf78c9cc6b779eb39c4de5cc73d57e8bdcaac5e67c3fc7542","reason":"The experimental SCITT evidence mapper for VSTD receipts applies as PROTOCOL. Its named participants, ordered states and transitions, compatibility, replay, failure, progress, and recovery form a protocol boundary; a network or cross-process exchange is not inferred unless declared. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"PROTOCOL-0.2-ordering-and-replay":{"declaration":{"compatibility":"Canonical JSON and SHA-256 bind mapping records; pinned draft algorithms derive subjects; strict adapters validate normalized caller-supplied native VSTD and SCITT verifier evidence without implementing signing or transport.","message_authority":"Only explicit relying-party issuer/profile selections and separately supplied native verifier outcomes authorize a local mapping decision; embedded PASS text and templates are never self-authorizing.","ordering":"Create and bind the VSTD payload before external SCITT production; consume native evidence before composition; composition never upgrades either input's epistemic strength.","replay":"Re-mapping exact inputs is deterministic; replay acceptance, service registration, and receipt freshness remain responsibilities of the external native protocols."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:6c6d3831f230c7fcf78c9cc6b779eb39c4de5cc73d57e8bdcaac5e67c3fc7542","reason":"The experimental SCITT evidence mapper for VSTD receipts applies as PROTOCOL. Its named participants, ordered states and transitions, compatibility, replay, failure, progress, and recovery form a protocol boundary; a network or cross-process exchange is not inferred unless declared. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"PROTOCOL-0.3-failures-and-progress":{"declaration":{"failure_assumptions":"Malformed or ambiguous mappings, digest/subject/issuer mismatch, unsupported revisions/states, absent native verification, or noncanonical derived inputs fail or remain explicitly unknown.","liveness":"Only supplied registration/profile window fields are represented; no network occurrence, service availability, freshness acquisition, or liveness is performed here.","recovery":"Obtain current native VSTD and SCITT verification evidence for the exact payload or correct the pinned mapping inputs, then compose afresh without upgrading retained unknowns.","safety":"Pinned draft revisions/profiles, exact fields, canonical JSON, bounded identifier/input lengths, SHA-256 equality, accepted issuer sets, and monotone state tables bound mapping."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:6c6d3831f230c7fcf78c9cc6b779eb39c4de5cc73d57e8bdcaac5e67c3fc7542","reason":"The experimental SCITT evidence mapper for VSTD receipts applies as PROTOCOL. Its named participants, ordered states and transitions, compatibility, replay, failure, progress, and recovery form a protocol boundary; a network or cross-process exchange is not inferred unless declared. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"ROBOT-0.1-agent-to-actuator-binding":{"declaration":{"actuators":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","agent":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","controllers":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","harness":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:43099f1799bec462cfa3f1b0ee11ca2323a3178fc8da5db31ead98a43df7d22f","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-robot-vstd-scitt-evidence-protocol-43f3780ec221; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"ROBOT-0.2-physical-reach-and-observation":{"declaration":{"confinement_evidence":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","domain_crossings":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","observations":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","physical_reach":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:43099f1799bec462cfa3f1b0ee11ca2323a3178fc8da5db31ead98a43df7d22f","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-robot-vstd-scitt-evidence-protocol-43f3780ec221; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"ROBOT-0.3-consequences-and-intervention":{"declaration":{"hazards":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","intervention":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","operating_limits":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","safe_state_or_continuity":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:43099f1799bec462cfa3f1b0ee11ca2323a3178fc8da5db31ead98a43df7d22f","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-robot-vstd-scitt-evidence-protocol-43f3780ec221; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"SENSOR-0.1-acquisition-and-observations":{"declaration":{"acquisition":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","deployment":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","measurements":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","phenomena":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:43099f1799bec462cfa3f1b