ry, unknown, source-bound, stale, PASS coverage, FAIL conflict, and UNKNOWN support states."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:69de165ac808601b15c009b766b9b6a9ced019a2a446f4b9d084c45db163b0cd","reason":"The installed Facet reason ledger applies as LEDGER. Its authoritative ordered reason denominator, identity, correction, replay, and recovery semantics cannot be reduced to generic data. Reviewed boundary: Reason coverage does not establish route outcomes, normative completeness, whole-tier or application polish, release, or deployment readiness. Audited source anchor: self_polish_facet_reasons.py:922-941,1101-1135,1230-1269,1497-1553. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"LEDGER-0.2-accounting-invariants":{"declaration":{"balance_rules":"The installed Facet reason ledger is an ordered event/accounting ledger, not a fungible balance sheet. Its invariant is the exact authorized and ordered commit contract: Commit is only return of the named bounded in-process record after its declared checks. It is not an atomic external commit, tier PASS, application qualification, release, or deployment.","rounding":"The installed Facet reason ledger records exact discrete events and byte digests; it defines no numeric rounding convention or financial balance.","sources_and_sinks":"Construct or replay the complete reason ledger and return exact source-bound coverage and assessment records without changing the installed registry.","units":"Exact bytes, SHA-256 digests, finite route/candidate/obligation counts, ordered records, and explicit PASS, FAIL, UNKNOWN, or lifecycle labels."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:69de165ac808601b15c009b766b9b6a9ced019a2a446f4b9d084c45db163b0cd","reason":"The installed Facet reason ledger applies as LEDGER. Its authoritative ordered reason denominator, identity, correction, replay, and recovery semantics cannot be reduced to generic data. Reviewed boundary: Reason coverage does not establish route outcomes, normative completeness, whole-tier or application polish, release, or deployment readiness. Audited source anchor: self_polish_facet_reasons.py:922-941,1101-1135,1230-1269,1497-1553. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"LEDGER-0.3-correction-and-recovery":{"declaration":{"corrections":"The installed Facet reason ledger does not rewrite an accepted history entry; later action is a new ordered event or a separately retained recovery operation.","reconciliation":"Facet and route membership, role contracts, source digests, choice rows, reason text, support projection, assessment status, and blockers.","recovery":"Retain the failure or UNKNOWN boundary, correct the exact input or source condition, and explicitly start a fresh evaluation; never upgrade an earlier or partial result.","replay":"Each call is a new evaluation of its selected inputs and current source. No retained result, duplicate identity, rollback, or general idempotency is inferred."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:69de165ac808601b15c009b766b9b6a9ced019a2a446f4b9d084c45db163b0cd","reason":"The installed Facet reason ledger applies as LEDGER. Its authoritative ordered reason denominator, identity, correction, replay, and recovery semantics cannot be reduced to generic data. Reviewed boundary: Reason coverage does not establish route outcomes, normative completeness, whole-tier or application polish, release, or deployment readiness. Audited source anchor: self_polish_facet_reasons.py:922-941,1101-1135,1230-1269,1497-1553. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"MARKET-0.1-orders-and-access":{"declaration":{"cancellation":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","order_states":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","participant_access":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","validation":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:69de165ac808