 alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-sim-trace-assessor (Tiered simulation trace, invariant, abstraction, agent-parity, and sharding assessor.) has only caller invocation and source-declared authority. Ownership review grants no human, legal, physical, financial, or release authority.","commands":"vstd-sim-trace-assessor declaration basis sha256:2f735d75f170df53bcbbb2e0f91c8678bddae4bb0b204410c2a8e0b94138ad96 binds exact source src/verifier/corrigibility/simulation.py; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-sim-trace-assessor (Tiered simulation trace, invariant, abstraction, agent-parity, and sharding assessor.) can submit only calls, callbacks, decisions, or records implemented by its owned sources; downstream effects require separate evidence.","effect_domains":"vstd-sim-trace-assessor declaration basis sha256:2f735d75f170df53bcbbb2e0f91c8678bddae4bb0b204410c2a8e0b94138ad96 binds exact source src/verifier/corrigibility/simulation.py; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-sim-trace-assessor (Tiered simulation trace, invariant, abstraction, agent-parity, and sharding assessor.) is bounded to declared software effects. No physical or real-money effect domain is inferred from source ownership.","targets":"vstd-sim-trace-assessor declaration basis sha256:2f735d75f170df53bcbbb2e0f91c8678bddae4bb0b204410c2a8e0b94138ad96 binds exact source src/verifier/corrigibility/simulation.py; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-sim-trace-assessor (Tiered simulation trace, invariant, abstraction, agent-parity, and sharding assessor.) is limited to in-process values and any files, process