 Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"MEASUREMENT-0.2-units-time-and-uncertainty":{"declaration":{"arrival_time":"source-provenance observer records parent receipt/completion ordering; it does not reconstruct an unobserved child or external event time.","observation_time":"Git queries and provenance walks have finite timeouts/deadlines; timestamps and commit history are observations of selected records, not authenticated authorship or independently witnessed precommit time.","reference_frame":"One selected local Git repository, its exact objects/index/worktree metadata, bounded ordinary source files and authored input documents, fixed Git children, and in-memory outputs.","uncertainty":"Only the mutable worktree-state capture observes selected source with repository-configured fsmonitor execution disabled; the object-database paths assert neither index refresh nor fsmonitor behavior. They establish neither authorship, requirement authority, test execution, runtime correctness, complete objective or full-application polish, publication, ROBOT, nor FINBOT consequences.","units":"Exact bytes, files/commits/definitions/regions/candidates/nodes/lines, time seconds, Git modes, and SHA-256 identities."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:c9e2e5639f2f1962bef4257fe14058438e6068f4ff22a6c9a40a9c7bda0db301","reason":"source-provenance observer applies as MEASUREMENT. Its retained parent-boundary values distinguish what was observed from child or external state that was not observed. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"MEASUREMENT-0.3-validity-and-missingness":{"declaration":{"freshness":"Git queries and provenance walks have finite timeouts/deadlines; timestamps and commit history are observations of selected records, not authenticated authorship or independently witnessed precommit time.","missingness":"Malformed/substituted input or supported contradiction FAILS; unavailable 