cal or financial endpoints accumulate ROBOT or FINBOT and every other applicable role.","status":"DOES_NOT_APPLY"},"MODEL":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","reason":"UNRESOLVED.","status":"UNRESOLVED"},"OWNER":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","reason":"UNRESOLVED.","status":"UNRESOLVED"},"POLICY":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:7c33b5a3b0a9b4c9c097c6aa2b1d839d006dba8e2a502253c9a7e79079d326bd","reason":"TRAIN control session applies as POLICY. Its rule selection, authority, defaults, and enforcement points decide whether a consequential operation may proceed.","status":"APPLIES"},"PROTOCOL":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","reason":"UNRESOLVED.","status":"UNRESOLVED"},"RECEIPT":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","reason":"UNRESOLVED.","status":"UNRESOLVED"},"ROBOT":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","reason":"UNRESOLVED.","status":"UNRESOLVED"},"ROLE":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","reason":"UNRESOLVED.","status":"UNRESOLVED"},"SENSOR":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:7c33b5a3b0a9b4c9c097c6aa2b1d839d006dba8e2a502253c9a7e79079d326bd","reason":"TRAIN control session does not apply as SENSOR. It has no separately owned acquisition producer with calibration/range semantics; reading supplied bytes or callback state is not enough. Reviewed boundary: Trusted-host mediation is not a sandbox, and callback submission is not downstream effect proof. Physical or financial endpoints accumulate ROBOT or FINBOT and every other applicable role.","status":"DOES_NOT_APPLY"},"SIM":{"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","reason":"UNRESOLVED.","status":"UNRES