":{"POLICY-0.1-rules-and-precedence":{"declaration":{"decision_inputs":"vstd-vgsat-architecture-documents declaration basis sha256:475f7720acd8e38aa2fb23079c8ddb691e50050b1532a913303d029a23f85e6d binds exact source experiments/verifier_guided_sat/ARCHITECTURE.md, experiments/verifier_guided_sat/README.md, experiments/verifier_guided_sat/VERIFIER_OBJECT_CONTRACT.md; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-vgsat-architecture-documents (Verifier-guided SAT dataflow, public layout and experiment-local verifier-object contract.) accepts only its exact current source bytes and the bounded values those sources explicitly admit; undeclared external state is not input.","defaults":"vstd-vgsat-architecture-documents declaration basis sha256:475f7720acd8e38aa2fb23079c8ddb691e50050b1532a913303d029a23f85e6d binds exact source experiments/verifier_guided_sat/ARCHITECTURE.md, experiments/verifier_guided_sat/README.md, experiments/verifier_guided_sat/VERIFIER_OBJECT_CONTRACT.md; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-vgsat-architecture-documents (Verifier-guided SAT dataflow, public layout and experiment-local verifier-object contract.) treats invalid, unavailable, contradictory, partial, or stale inputs as refusal or UNKNOWN rather than silently inferring success.","precedence":"vstd-vgsat-architecture-documents declaration basis sha256:475f7720acd8e38aa2fb23079c8ddb691e50050b1532a913303d029a23f85e6d binds exact source experiments/verifier_guided_sat/ARCHITECTURE.md, experiments/verifier_guided_sat/README.md, experiments/verifier_guided_sat/VERIFIER_OBJECT_CONTRACT.md; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-vgsat-