 harness, verifier, metric and result-file orchestration.) is bounded to declared software effects. No physical or real-money effect domain is inferred from source ownership.","targets":"vstd-vgsat-benchmark-controller declaration basis sha256:a9540175a3aadd131c7d349883432263265dbfb1d81ff27a34e5a5528f148cf3 binds exact source experiments/verifier_guided_sat/verifier_guided_sat/benchmark.py; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-vgsat-benchmark-controller (Mode-selected corpus, freeze, MODEL, harness, verifier, metric and result-file orchestration.) is limited to in-process values and any files, processes, or endpoints explicitly selected by its owned sources."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:643a9f4d77ffe7aeb061d8eb7baba7d39e3a172b41ecd17cd0babb49d09beb36","reason":"vstd-vgsat-benchmark-controller (Mode-selected corpus, freeze, MODEL, harness, verifier, metric and result-file orchestration.) applies as ACTUATOR. Its owned source connects an accepted command to a represented real or simulated effect endpoint and exposes effect feedback plus an explicit failure surface. Submission, dispatch, replay, callback entry, or child-process launch alone is insufficient. Audited semantic basis: vstd-vgsat-benchmark-controller owns Mode-selected corpus, freeze, MODEL, harness, verifier, metric and result-file orchestration. Exact current source-byte denominator: experiments/verifier_guided_sat/verifier_guided_sat/benchmark.py. Fixed operands: data=vstd-vgsat-instance-corpus, verifier=vstd-vgsat-native-verifier-adapters. Necessity: A benchmark controller chooses consequential execution order, one-request stop conditions and output publication, so model transport, current observations and partial failure cannot be hidden behind a CLI success code. Consequence boundary: The controller is unsandboxed and writes local files; it does not authorize an endpoint, prove MODEL confinement or identity, create a BOT, control physical hardware, transact money, publish results or establish any success classification without validated trial evidence. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed exact-source boundary only; mechanism execution, semantic truth, and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"ACTUATOR-0.2-response-and-limits":{"declaration":{"limits":"vstd-vgsat-benchmark-controller declaration basis sha256:a9540175a3aadd131c7d349883432263265dbfb1d81ff27a34e5a5528f148cf3 binds exact source experiments/verifier_guided_sat/verifier_guided_sat/benchmark.py; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-vgsat-benchmark-controller (Mode-selected corpus, freeze, MODEL, harness, verifier, metric and result-file orchestration.) is bounded by limits explicit in its exact source and declared role. Missing limits are not invented by this review.","response":"vstd-vgsat-benchmark-controller declaration basis sha256:a9540175a3aadd131c7d349883432263265dbfb1d81ff27a34e5a5528f148cf3 binds exact source experiments/verifier_guided_sat/verifier_guided_sat/benchmark.py; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execution truth. Field declaration: vstd-vgsat-benchmark-controller (Mode-selected corpus, freeze, MODEL, harness, verifier, metric and result-file orchestration.) exposes only source-defined return values, records, or diagnostics; they are not promoted to semantic or external-world truth.","saturation":"vstd-vgsat-benchmark-controller declaration basis sha256:a9540175a3aadd131c7d349883432263265dbfb1d81ff27a34e5a5528f148cf3 binds exact source experiments/verifier_guided_sat/verifier_guided_sat/benchmark.py; source role, necessity, consequence boundary, operands, and path set are hash-bound; declaration text alone establishes no execut