, capacity exhausted, or protocol refused.","transitions":"Response files preserve request order; workflow/job/step/reference ordering follows the composed YAML declaration."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:70a0e58452b8cac85457ff70160d0aba61344c702b6b488513ee8f085114b396","reason":"workflow parser exchange applies as PROTOCOL. Its participants exchange ordered requests/responses across a process or remote boundary with explicit compatibility and failure states. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"PROTOCOL-0.2-ordering-and-replay":{"declaration":{"compatibility":"A fixed Python -I -B worker pins PyYAML bytes, uses BaseLoader composition, rejects aliases/tags/directives/duplicate keys, and rebinds source digests.","message_authority":"The parent authorizes static parsing only; no referenced action download or workflow command execution is authorized.","ordering":"Response files preserve request order; workflow/job/step/reference ordering follows the composed YAML declaration.","replay":"A repeat parse is a new current-byte census; unresolved references/expressions remain gaps rather than cached success."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:70a0e58452b8cac85457ff70160d0aba61344c702b6b488513ee8f085114b396","reason":"workflow parser exchange applies as PROTOCOL. Its participants exchange ordered requests/responses across a process or remote boundary with explicit compatibility and failure states. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"PROTOCOL-0.3-failures-and-progress":{"declaration":{"failure_assumptions":"Parser absence, malformed/recursive YAML, unresolved expression/reference/runtime, or shape ambiguity remains explicit.","liveness":"The parent enforces a finite worker timeout; no runner or workflow liveness is claimed.","recovery":"Install pinned PyYAML or bind the missing interpreter/reference/evaluation inputs and rerun without executing the workflow.","safety":"Input/output bytes, YAML tokens/nodes/depth, files, paths, keys, references, and parser version are bounded."},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:70a0e58452b8cac85457ff70160d0aba61344c702b6b488513ee8f085114b396","reason":"workflow parser exchange applies as PROTOCOL. Its participants exchange ordered requests/responses across a process or remote boundary with explicit compatibility and failure states. This Tier-0 declaration names the reviewed boundary only; mechanism execution and Tier-1-plus fulfillment remain unestablished."},"ROBOT-0.1-agent-to-actuator-binding":{"declaration":{"actuators":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","agent":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","controllers":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","harness":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:be2503eb19c42e1a5df9a1be1a18696b3668e6250e8dcbb97de66bba7867f7a9","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-robot-vstd-workflow-parser-protocol-b0bd7ad04e21; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"ROBOT-0.2-physical-reach-and-observation":{"declaration":{"confinement_evidence":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","domain_crossings":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","observations":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","physical_reach":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:be2503eb19c42e1a5df9a1be1a18696b3668e6250e8dcbb97de66bba7867f7a9","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-robot-vstd-workflow-parser-protocol-b0bd7ad04e21; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"ROBOT-0.3-consequences-and-intervention":{"declaration":{"hazards":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","intervention":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","operating_limits":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","safe_state_or_continuity":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence_set_digest":"sha256:be2503eb19c42e1a5df9a1be1a18696b3668e6250e8dcbb97de66bba7867f7a9","reason":"reasons.vstd:tier0-robot-vstd-workflow-parser-protocol-b0bd7ad04e21; fulfillment NOT_ESTABLISHED."},"SENSOR-0.1-acquisition-and-observations":{"declaration":{"acquisition":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","deployment":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","measurements":"NOT_ESTABLISHED","phenomena":"NOT_ESTABLISHED"},"evidence